pi.github.com/users/JWadeOn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/commits/4e2d84a29fba105c433e71cf66e59269a023f1fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T20:06:46Z","email":"justinwbuckner@gmail.com","name":"JWadeOn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T20:06:46Z","email":"justinwbuckner@gmail.com","name":"JWadeOn"},"message":"test: lock in Strategic Execution logic — 51 unit tests\n\nAdds four test classes covering the core execution invariants:\n\n- WeightEngineTest: canonical piece weights (KING=20, PAWN=1), alignment %\n  arithmetic, inverted-outcome progress formula (Start=20,Target=10,Current=12→80%),\n  and OutcomeDto.inverted flag detection.\n\n- PivotValidationTest: ghost-capacity path (1 BUMPED + 0 ACTIVE → QUEEN allowed),\n  insufficient-capacity rejection, double-displacement guard, KLO pivot acceptance.\n\n- KloIsolationTest: KLO excluded from alignment numerator (50% score), strategic\n  purity at 100% when all strategic items are outcome-linked, capacity = 20/40,\n  ManagerService.getTeamAlignment verified end-to-end.\n\n- IntegrityGuardrailTest: @Size(min=20) / @NotBlank annotation contract on\n  actionTaken field, Jakarta Validator boundary tests (19 chars fails, 20 passes),\n  service persists trimmed actionTaken verbatim in OutcomeUpdate audit record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7a3d603f94bc73bf1a4904643db8f1db13bf1ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/trees/d7a3d603f94bc73bf1a4904643db8f1db13bf1ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/commits/4e2d84a29fba105c433e71cf66e59269a023f1fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35391496?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g