antage Rule tooltip\n- New reusable <SuccessGauge> component (compact + full modes): horizontal track,\n  achievement %, green/gray/red color logic, ⚡ team-weight energy icon overlay,\n  amber stale warning after 7 days\n- SuccessGauge integrated into TeamOutcomesSidebar (compact) and ManagerDashboard (full)\n- ManagerDashboard gets a Friday Pulse section with inline currentValue editing,\n  amber input ring for stale outcomes, and Friday-specific header\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4de88ec3a7dcad0ea42085c5b14db3f9d83223d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/trees/c4de88ec3a7dcad0ea42085c5b14db3f9d83223d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/commits/c1745cc4e3ad2d06dcd4a267a3410cb40701650f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35391496?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JWadeOn","id":35391496,"login":"JWadeOn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzkxNDk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/commit/c1745cc4e3ad2d06dcd4a267a3410cb40701650f","node_id":"C_kwDORgVwh9oAKGMxNzQ1Y2M0ZTNhZDJkMDZkY2Q0YTI2