ngObjectiveTitle()\n  helpers.\n\n- Replace the flat Rally Cry list + separate DO gauge row with a\n  NorthStarViz SVG component: golden star (Rally Cry) at top, dashed\n  tree connectors branching down to a circular progress gauge per\n  Defining Objective. Gauges are color-coded green/blue/orange by\n  effort percentage. Dashboard now fetches the full RCDO hierarchy\n  (/manager/rcdo) and merges it with live alignment data so ALL active\n  DOs are always shown — including those with 0% effort this week.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"992b4291afc148bd021db57ace2ea8a81a9d64ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/trees/992b4291afc148bd021db57ace2ea8a81a9d64ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/commits/e47277000e9c003f3957735f64855e273056067c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35391496?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JWadeOn","id":35391496,"login":"JWadeOn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzkxNDk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/commit/e47277000e9c003f3957735f64855e273056067c","node