"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/commits/3bb2be94226f2a88fd5ca51dd1bd64deb37dec4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T21:05:41Z","email":"justinwbuckner@gmail.com","name":"JWadeOn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T21:05:41Z","email":"justinwbuckner@gmail.com","name":"JWadeOn"},"message":"fix: resolve OAuth2 browser login loop — SameSite cookies + mock server consent\n\nRoot causes and fixes:\n- JSESSIONID had no SameSite attribute; Chrome dropped it on the cross-port\n  redirect from IS4 (8090) back to Spring (8080), causing\n  authorization_request_not_found. Fix: server.servlet.session.cookie.same-site=lax\n- IS4 mock server auth cookies (idsrv/idsrv.session) used SameSite=None without\n  Secure, rejected by Chrome 80+. Fix: SERVER_OPTIONS_INLINE CookieSameSiteMode=Lax\n- IS4 mock server required user consent by default, triggering access_denied after\n  login. Fix: RequireConsent=false in CLIENTS_CONFIGURATION_INLINE\n- SecurityConfig: added SessionCreationPolicy.IF_REQUIRED, @Slf4j, failure handler\n  redirecting to localhost:3000/auth-error\n- application.yml: explicit jwk-set-uri, Docker-internal issuer-uri for token\n  validation, session cookie SameSite config\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dc78115793ac23c46955dc0b1609ab9fdf9ca13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/trees/4dc78115793ac23c46955dc0b1609ab9fdf9ca13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JWadeOn/weekly-commit/git/commits/3bb2be94226f2a88fd5ca51dd1bd64deb37dec4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35391496?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JWadeOn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a