i.github.com/users/quandole-oss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/784948ee2fea1ab0fd4af05139dc7c219c80ac69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T03:09:27Z","email":"quandole@gmail.com","name":"Quan Le"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T03:09:27Z","email":"quandole@gmail.com","name":"Quan Le"},"message":"chore: bootstrap Yarn Workspaces / Nx monorepo at repo root\n\nSpec: Yarn Workspaces + Nx monorepo. Introduces:\n- Root package.json with \"workspaces\": [\"frontend\"] (npm-compatible\n  workspace syntax that Yarn also honors)\n- Root scripts for dev/build/test/e2e/bdd/lint/format/contracts plus\n  backend:build / backend:up / backend:down via docker compose\n- nx.json with namedInputs, targetDefaults (build/test/lint with cache),\n  and production input filters\n\nBackend remains outside the Node workspace by design — it''s a Maven\nproject and Nx treats it as opaque; deployment orchestration stays in\ndocker-compose.yml. Full Nx integration (nx run, generators, affected\nbuilds) is deferred and documented in DECISIONS.md.\n\nRegression: 65 vitest tests green via `npm run test` from root,\ncontracts verify 15/15 via `npm run contracts:verify` from root.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2ea12f85be9e785d1e3c861395b7547e7f50f00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/e2ea12f85be9e785d1e3c861395b7547e7f50f00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/784948ee2fea1ab0fd4af05139dc7c219c80ac69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse