","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss","id":252654946,"login":"quandole-oss","node_id":"U_kgDODw81Yg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/fd99bcb1421cda0c10573a21aa74e4afc221cc61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T03:08:41Z","email":"quandole@gmail.com","name":"Quan Le"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T03:08:41Z","email":"quandole@gmail.com","name":"Quan Le"},"message":"chore(frontend): add ESLint 9 flat config + Prettier 3 config\n\nSpec: ESLint 9 + Prettier 3.3. Installed:\n- eslint@9.39.4 (flat config)\n- prettier@3.8.3 (>=3.3)\n- @eslint/js@9\n- typescript-eslint@8\n- eslint-plugin-react + eslint-plugin-react-hooks\n- eslint-config-prettier (prevents formatter/linter fights)\n\nConfig intent: permissive, ratcheting. Current codebase passes with only\n2 low-signal warnings (missing dep in one useEffect, unused import in one\ntest). Zero errors, so nothing blocks builds. Raise severity as the\ncodebase catches up.\n\nNew scripts:\n- npm run lint\n- npm run lint:fix\n- npm run format\n- npm run format:check\n\nRegression: 65 vitest tests green, 6 Playwright+BDD tests green,\ncontracts unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de69c638b58cb0f1fe48e85f9668f53bda1ae915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/de69c638b58cb0f1fe48e85f9668f53bda1ae915"},"url":"https://api.github.com/r