as the Sign Out action in SettingsPage. This is a deliberate minimal swap\nto avoid visual/test regressions across the app; full primitive migration\n(Card, Input, Modal, etc.) deferred and documented in DECISIONS.md.\n\nImport chain: SettingsPage imports { Button as FlowbiteButton } from\n\"flowbite-react\" and renders it with color=\"red\" for the destructive\nsign-out action.\n\nRegression:\n- tsc --noEmit clean\n- 65 vitest tests still green (text selectors unchanged: button still\n  reads \"Sign Out\")\n- vite production build succeeds; flowbite-react code-split into its\n  own chunk\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"beb1e2ce28f47c58641cfb6bafde6d0a027f7f2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/beb1e2ce28f47c58641cfb6bafde6d0a027f7f2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/4a99dbdf508ff9baec3ecfa4ff7a1b81a938cc43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252654946?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss","id":252654946,"login":"quandole-oss","node_id":"U_kgDODw81Yg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/subscriptions","type":"User