s/quandole-oss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/554e2926ebc23a96ded161d096558a64ddeab78f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:05:35Z","email":"quandole@gmail.com","name":"Quan Le"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:05:35Z","email":"quandole@gmail.com","name":"Quan Le"},"message":"feat(backend): add Pageable list endpoints (additive)\n\nSpec requires Spring Data Pageable for team views up to 2000 records.\nExisting List<> endpoints are untouched to avoid breaking frontend\nconsumers; new paginated variants are added alongside:\n\n- GET /api/v1/commits/page         ?page&size&sort       -> Page<WeeklyCommitDto>\n- GET /api/v1/teams/{id}/members/page                    -> Page<TeamMemberDto>\n\nRepository additions:\n- TeamMemberRepository.findByTeamId(UUID, Pageable)\n\nService additions:\n- CommitService.listCommitsPage(Pageable)\n\nBackend Docker build: SUCCESS. Contract snapshots unchanged (additive\nendpoints only; existing endpoints untouched).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6965e7f98fecf3faf05315cfb55f2f7195f033ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/6965e7f98fecf3faf05315cfb55f2f7195f033ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/554e2926ebc23a96ded161d096558a64ddeab78f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252654946?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/followers","following_url":"https://api.g