arkdown/remark-gfm deps).\n- Backend: mvn test red at baseline (3 failures, 28 errors from\n  ApplicationContext load failure in integration tests) - PRE-EXISTING,\n  not introduced by this work. Regression signal substituted with API\n  contract snapshots against live Railway deploy + Playwright smoke\n  against local docker-compose.\n\nAlso: ignore .claude/settings.local.json (machine-local) and add missing\nignore entries for playwright artifacts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a4eae3dd7e8f18f31085c569a773754805c8486","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/9a4eae3dd7e8f18f31085c569a773754805c8486"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/439ea965a7f4995a4e0745d9cbf39538510c31fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252654946?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss","id":252654946,"login":"quandole-oss","node_id":"U_kgDODw81Yg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quandole-oss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner