/inputs, gradient buttons\n- Pipeline: polished column cards with colored dots, improved drag cards with meta pills\n- RCDO Browser: modern accordion with teal toggle icons, objective count badges\n- StatusBadge: dot + label design replacing shimmer animation\n- FibonacciSelector: gradient selected state, rounded-xl buttons\n- AISummaryPanel: premium card design with AI icon\n- GlowButton: added style prop support\n- Global: Inter font, custom scrollbar, refined shadows, consistent border radii","tree":{"sha":"600923f7978f91ef18542064d45c78d053cf2b24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/600923f7978f91ef18542064d45c78d053cf2b24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/fa70cf341059cfa21b0d6b520a58ea44774f2b2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232843644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tuzitnik","id":232843644,"login":"tuzitnik","node_id":"U_kgDODeDpfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tuzitnik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/fa70cf341059cfa21b0d6b520a58ea44774f2b2f","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKGZhNzBjZjM0MTA1OWNmYTIxYjBkNmI1MjBhNThlYTQ0Nzc0ZjJiMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9","sha":"8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9"}],"sha":"fa70cf341059cfa21b0d6b520a58ea44774f2b2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/fa70cf341059cfa21b0d6b520a58ea44774f2b2f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T00:24:11Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T00:24:11Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix timezone bug in getCurrentMonday() causing empty Pipeline\n\ntoISOString() converts to UTC, which shifts the date forward by a day\nfor users in negative-UTC timezones (Americas). The frontend sent\nweekStart=2026-03-10 while the DB stored 2026-03-09, causing no match.\nUse local date formatting instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a0182db0118a61670bbec0007977268bfb5cfad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/8a0182db0118a61670bbec0007977268bfb5cfad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDgxODVmMGJiMzU4YjNhZjc4NTM4ZDYxMjcwYmY4NTc1NzMyMmQ5Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa","sha":"c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa"}],"sha":"8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/8185f0bb358b3af78538d61270bf85757322d9f9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T22:31:24Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T22:31:24Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix cross-page data sync: shared team context, week filtering, cache invalidation\n\nAdd TeamContext (persisted to sessionStorage) so team selection carries\nacross Dashboard, Pipeline, and CommitEditor pages. Filter Pipeline\ncommits to current week via optional weekStart query param on the\nbackend. Invalidate both [\"commits\"] and [\"dashboard\"] caches on all\nmutations so cross-page data stays fresh. Sidebar Dashboard link now\nroutes to the selected team''s dashboard.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f58e9d1ed68ed54aad28255b5a0a87fa98c1dfd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/f58e9d1ed68ed54aad28255b5a0a87fa98c1dfd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKGMxM2JiNzAwNzM5ZGIzZWY3YTllNmIwYTBmZjJkZTcyOGE2Mzc5YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356","sha":"ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356"}],"sha":"c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/c13bb700739db3ef7a9e6b0a0ff2de728a6379aa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T22:04:23Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T22:04:23Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix performance bottlenecks: N+1 queries, full table scan, unminified JS, missing timeouts\n\n- Replace findAll().filter() in getAlignmentMetrics() with findByWeekStartWithItems() query\n- Add JOIN FETCH to WeeklyCommitRepository queries to eliminate N+1 on items/teamMember\n- Add Hibernate default_batch_fetch_size=16 and remove format_sql overhead\n- Enable esbuild minification and CSS code splitting in Vite\n- Add gzip compression to nginx config\n- Add 5s connect / 15s read timeout to AI summary RestClient\n- Remove duplicate CORS processing in WebConfig (already handled by SecurityConfig)\n- Lazy-load non-critical frontend routes (CommitEditor, Reconciliation, Pipeline, Rcdo)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ead9964774f404c8849945374fbfc40ead6bbaca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/ead9964774f404c8849945374fbfc40ead6bbaca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKGVmNTFhYThhNGE3ZmE0NjI3ZGM3YWE1YTI4ZjY0NDg5MmFiOTYzNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494","sha":"53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494"}],"sha":"ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/ef51aa8a4a7fa4627dc7aa5a28f644892ab96356"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:00:24Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T21:00:24Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Add V10 migration to refresh seed data for current week\n\nThe dashboard filters by the current ISO week, but V2 seed data was\nlocked to the week when that migration first ran. This re-seeds weekly\ncommits for Alice, Bob, Carol, and adds Quan Le so the dashboard\ndisplays populated data on deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e819736c0086f7e2c2d48ec0172a3403139d047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/2e819736c0086f7e2c2d48ec0172a3403139d047"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDUzYmY1OTZkY2VjYzdmYWJmYTBjN2Q5MTViMmI0Y2EwZTRmODY0OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128","sha":"2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128"}],"sha":"53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/53bf596dcecc7fabfa0c7d915b2b4ca0e4f86494"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T20:00:05Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T20:00:05Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix nginx crash on Railway: defer DNS resolution and handle backend errors\n\nnginx was failing to start because it resolves proxy_pass hostnames at\nstartup — the backend hostname doesn''t exist in Railway DNS. Use a\nvariable-based proxy_pass to defer resolution to request time. Add\nstructured JSON error responses when backend is unavailable, and catch\nnetwork errors in the API client to prevent unhandled exceptions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"321cea1dd2752a5ea80911c040aa8468f6d417ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/321cea1dd2752a5ea80911c040aa8468f6d417ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDJkODU0MTcyZDc5OTE5ZWM5N2Q4ZGFlM2EwMzQzMDU1ZmRkZGUxMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f","sha":"4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f"}],"sha":"2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/2d854172d79919ec97d8dae3a0343055fddde128"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T19:31:18Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T19:31:18Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix redirect loop in production: guard handle401, ProtectedRoute, and LoginPage\n\n- handle401: only redirect on 401 (not 403), skip if already on /login\n- ProtectedRoute: add loading guard so AuthContext can initialize before redirect\n- LoginPage: redirect authenticated users to / instead of showing login form\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d65d2088d45bd754b0068d2fd9b8b46f1fd3c6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/0d65d2088d45bd754b0068d2fd9b8b46f1fd3c6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDQzOTNlNmNlNDI2NjQ1NTRiOTgzNGY5NGZjMGMyMGI2M2EwYmFiMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f","sha":"35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f"}],"sha":"4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/4393e6ce42664554b9834f94fc0c20b63a0bab2f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T16:20:37Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T16:20:37Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix 403 on unauthenticated requests: return 401 and handle in frontend\n\nBackend: Add authenticationEntryPoint to return 401 instead of Spring\nSecurity''s default 403 for unauthenticated requests.\n\nFrontend: Handle both 401 and 403 responses by redirecting to login.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"063c115b4356cb007754409e0aa0a2d45d6af2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/063c115b4356cb007754409e0aa0a2d45d6af2c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDM1ZDhmNDliMTIzNjBhM2EwNGZiNTJhOTg2MzljNWZlMzEzMjcxMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a","sha":"b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a"}],"sha":"35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/35d8f49b12360a3a04fb52a98639c5fe3132712f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T23:34:03Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T23:34:03Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Add interactive pipeline, task modal, AI enhancements, and deep linking\n\n- F4: TaskDetailsModal with two-column layout (info + audit timeline),\n  mock notes/attachments, focus trap, Escape close; CommitItemCard onClick\n- F3: Faux-AI summary service with 6 mock templates, shimmer animation,\n  word-by-word typing reveal effect on AISummaryPanel\n- F1: Drag-and-drop pipeline page with @dnd-kit, 5 status columns,\n  StatusChangeModal with audit-enforced justification, override mutation\n- F2: Cross-team deep linking via URL search params (?openItem=id),\n  backend by-outcome endpoint, RCDO Browser shows linked commit items\n\nAll 65 tests pass across 15 test files. TypeScript compiles clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e855b595ee8f6575f66e2d2efe40a70da6e8c94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/5e855b595ee8f6575f66e2d2efe40a70da6e8c94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKGIzOWQ1YmY2YjJiOGEwYjQ2MDQ1ZTg1NjFlNThhNWNiZjZjMmJjNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e","sha":"9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e"}],"sha":"b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b39d5bf6b2b8a0b46045e8561e58a5cbf6c2bc5a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T23:13:08Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T23:13:08Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix audit log LazyInitializationException and add seed data\n\nAdd @Transactional(readOnly = true) to getAuditLog() so the Hibernate\nsession stays open during lazy proxy resolution. Add V9 migration to\nseed audit log entries for the existing V2 demo data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f926aaf02bb4e107359d28cab25658200b250f24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/f926aaf02bb4e107359d28cab25658200b250f24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDlmNmYxOTQ5MjZmZDVmNjgzZWI2NmQxNmEyM2JlOGFjOTcwMjQ0MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73","sha":"4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73"}],"sha":"9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/9f6f194926fd5f683eb66d16a23be8ac9702441e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:56:45Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:56:45Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix: pass VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID as Docker build arg\n\nVite env vars must be available at build time. Add ARG/ENV for\nVITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in Dockerfile, matching VITE_DEMO_MODE pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a32e66b7599d3df5c8a2d22391bca618b8d6d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/3a32e66b7599d3df5c8a2d22391bca618b8d6d4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDQzMDNmNGUwNWZkYjEyMGI1ZDIyM2E3ZjhhM2Q4MzZlOTk1NzNkNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310","sha":"19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310"}],"sha":"4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/4303f4e05fdb120b5d223a7f8a3d836e99573d73"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:49:00Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:49:00Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Add Google OAuth sign-in (client-side ID token flow)\n\nBackend:\n- POST /api/v1/auth/oauth2/google verifies Google ID token, finds/creates user, issues JWT\n- GoogleTokenVerifier validates tokens via Google''s tokeninfo API\n- V8 migration adds google_id and avatar_url columns to team_member\n- Existing users matched by email get Google ID linked on first OAuth login\n\nFrontend:\n- Google Sign-In button on login page (only shown when VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is set)\n- GoogleOAuthProvider wraps app, googleLogin method added to AuthContext\n- Email/password form preserved as fallback below \"or\" divider\n\nActivate by setting GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (backend) and VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (frontend build arg).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f19ebb68753cf8062a99c1baaf4de89b2dbfe53c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/f19ebb68753cf8062a99c1baaf4de89b2dbfe53c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDE5ZmNmNzIwMzJjYzZhODQyNWZlNDE0ODlhM2Q5MjBjNjFhYmMzMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd","sha":"966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd"}],"sha":"19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/19fcf72032cc6a8425fe41489a3d920c61abc310"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:42:20Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:42:20Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix 502: pass correct Host header and enable SNI for backend proxy\n\n- Set proxy Host header to backend''s domain (not frontend''s)\n- Enable proxy_ssl_server_name for SNI with HTTPS backends\n- Add BACKEND_HOST env var (defaults to ''backend'' for docker-compose)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a540c808b046652f380cb61924966dcd85bc53d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/9a540c808b046652f380cb61924966dcd85bc53d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDk2NjA5OWU2M2VlODBjOTk3YTFhYTViNmFkMzhmM2M3NWYzZTk4ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f","sha":"b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f"}],"sha":"966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/966099e63ee80c997a1aa5b6ad38f3c75f3e98dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:40:22Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:40:22Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Simplify nginx proxy config with BACKEND_ORIGIN\n\n- Replace BACKEND_URL + BACKEND_PROTO with single BACKEND_ORIGIN\n- Remove resolver/variable approach that caused deployment failures\n- Default to http://backend:8080 for docker-compose compatibility\n- Railway uses https://backend-public-domain as BACKEND_ORIGIN\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03e794c5ee686a3d83070786f898c401c27f00f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/03e794c5ee686a3d83070786f898c401c27f00f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKGI0ZDNhMGQ0MDE4NTNkODhhODMxOTkzNzVlYmFiNjAxZTU5NWU2N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab","sha":"b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab"}],"sha":"b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b4d3a0d401853d88a83199375ebab601e595e67f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:36:51Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:36:51Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Support configurable backend protocol for Railway public URL\n\n- Add BACKEND_PROTO env var (defaults to http for docker-compose)\n- Enable IPv6 in nginx resolver for Railway private networking\n- Use public backend URL as Railway private networking fallback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45a07ca56d5a60eabc9ed406001ad11eaae6ad0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/45a07ca56d5a60eabc9ed406001ad11eaae6ad0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKGI2YjNlODAwZjA4YWNkMzkyNWVkMTA1NzgyMzUxNjBiNTliMjYxYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458","sha":"588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458"}],"sha":"b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/b6b3e800f08acd3925ed10578235160b59b261ab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:19:12Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:19:12Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix nginx DNS resolution for Railway private networking\n\n- Use dynamic resolver from /etc/resolv.conf for Railway internal DNS\n- Use nginx variable for proxy_pass to enable runtime DNS resolution\n- Add proxy timeout settings\n- Log resolved nginx config on startup for debugging\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b810c6f17d4cd71d1a992d13c59cd6617594bf32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/b810c6f17d4cd71d1a992d13c59cd6617594bf32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKDU4ODkzNzQzMzI1N2UzN2YzMzAxOTRmMzA0ZjEyOWEzOTE0NWU0NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5","sha":"f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5"}],"sha":"588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/588937433257e37f330194f304f129a39145e458"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:11:59Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:11:59Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Fix frontend: listen on Railway PORT, increase healthcheck timeout\n\n- nginx listens on $PORT (defaults to 80 for docker-compose)\n- envsubst now substitutes both BACKEND_URL and PORT\n- Healthcheck timeout increased from 10s to 30s\n- Remove default nginx config to avoid port conflicts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8ab9b04f9a65fc920959041e673219e69e0e3d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/trees/c8ab9b04f9a65fc920959041e673219e69e0e3d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/git/commits/f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5","node_id":"C_kwDORgZIaNoAKGYxYzlkZjNiNWY5ODMzZWJiMjlhNzc4MmU2NjIyOTZlMWE1MGM1YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commit/2160a9632b02ce7c58bb174b21eb7f2ba96d3c44","sha":"2160a9632b02ce7c58bb174b21eb7f2ba96d3c44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/2160a9632b02ce7c58bb174b21eb7f2ba96d3c44"}],"sha":"f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/f1c9df3b5f9833ebb29a7782e662296e1a50c5b5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quandole-oss/ST6-Hiring-Partner-Project/commits/2160a9632b02ce7c58bb174b21eb7f2ba96d3c44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:09:40Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T22:09:40Z","email":"q@Qs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Q"},"message":"Trigger Railway redeploy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dedb0