hub.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/dd029df69b173c0d3992ef00c96e3b5f43951979/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T22:30:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T12:51:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add TO operational panels: EscrowFunding, MomentumSurge, SponsorBidReview, PayoutSetup\n\nPANEL 1 — EscrowFundingPanel (src/components/to/EscrowFundingPanel.tsx)\n  - Shows: Required Escrow (prize pool), On Deposit balance, status chip (Unfunded/Partial/Funded)\n  - Animated progress bar for partial funding\n  - \"Fund Escrow\" modal with bank wire instructions (reference code + copy) or AEU wallet transfer\n  - Go Live button gated with tooltip: \"Event cannot go live until prize pool is fully escrowed\"\n  - \"Simulate Funding\" button in sandbox/dev mode (VITE_PAYMENT_ENV !== ''production'')\n  - Updates tournament escrowBalance and escrowStatus via useTournamentStore\n\nPANEL 2 — MomentumSurgeToggle (src/components/to/MomentumSurgeToggle.tsx)\n  - Toggle switch to enable/disable surge for a specific event\n  - Fill rate threshold slider (50-95%, step 5) with live bracket preview and surge indicator\n  - Surge banner message textarea with {spots} placeholder variable\n  - Token bonus selector (0/25/50/100/200 tokens) for surge registrations\n  - Animated banner preview showing exactly how it will look to players\n  - Syncs surgeEnabled, surgeThresholdPct, surgeMessage, surgeTokenBonus to store\n\nPANEL 3 — SponsorBidReviewPanel (src/components/to/SponsorBidReviewPanel.tsx)\n  - Table of pending/resolved sponsor bids per event\n  - Each row: logo, sponsor name, slot label, bid amount, bid type, timestamp, Accept/Reject actions\n  - Preview modal: mock bracket preview with animated placement (banner/overlay/MVP/ticker positions)\n  - Accept: fills slot, sends notification strip at panel top\n  - Reject: textarea modal for rejection reason, sent to sponsor\n  - Resolved bids collapsible section\n  - useToOpsStore (src/stores/toOps.ts): manages bid state + notifications with 4 mock bids\n\nPANEL 4 — PayoutSetupPanel (src/components/to/PayoutSetupPanel.tsx)\n  - 3-item compliance checklist: Bank Account Connected, Prize Pool Escrowed, W-9 on File\n  - Each item: ✓ (green) or ✗ (red) with description and action link\n  - All-clear message when all 3 pass; blocked message when any fail\n  - onReadyChange callback to gate publish button in CreateTournamentPage\n  - Wired into CreateTournamentPage before action buttons (only shown when prize pool > 0)\n  - Integrated publish gate: !hasPrizePool || payoutSetupReady\n\nWIRING\n  - TODashboard: new \"Event Ops Console\" section with tournament selector dropdown,\n    2-column grid (Escrow+Surge left, SponsorBids+PayoutSetup right)\n  - CreateTournamentPage: PayoutSetupPanel appears before publish when prize pool set;\n    fixed pre-existing bug: form.rules → rules\n\nTYPE EXTENSIONS (src/types/index.ts)\n  - Tournament: escrowBalance, escrowStatus, surgeEnabled, surgeThresholdPct,\n    surgeMessage, surgeTokenBonus, toPayoutSetup\n  - SponsorBid interface + SponsorBidStatus + SponsorBidType types\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA","tree":{"sha":"b1374997a3111d090a2154f8daf36a89078e51b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/b1374997a3111d090a2154f8daf36a89078e51b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/dd029df69b173c0d3992ef00c96e3b5f43951979","verification":{"payload":"tree b1374997a3111d090a2154f8daf36a89078e51b4\nparent 1644ef4461d1f9d37dfcbdbf13583f49b0594e1e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772577037 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772628711 +0000\n\nAdd TO operational panels: EscrowFunding, MomentumSurge, SponsorBidReview, PayoutSetup\n\nPANEL 1 — EscrowFundingPanel (src/components/to/EscrowFundingPanel.tsx)\n  - Shows: Required Escrow (prize pool), On Deposit balance, status chip (Unfunded/Partial/Funded)\n  - Animated progress bar for partial funding\n  - \"Fund Escrow\" modal with bank wire instructions (reference code + copy) or AEU wallet transfer\n  - Go Live button gated with tooltip: \"Event cannot go live until prize pool is fully escrowed\"\n  - \"Simulate Funding\" button in sandbox/dev mode (VITE_PAYMENT_ENV !== ''production'')\n  - Updates tournament escrowBalance and escrowStatus via useTournamentStore\n\nPANEL 2 — MomentumSurgeToggle (src/components/to/MomentumSurgeToggle.tsx)\n  - Toggle switch to enable/disable surge for a specific event\n  - Fill rate threshold slider (50-95%, step 5) with live bracket preview and surge indicator\n  - Surge banner message textarea with {spots} placeholder variable\n  - Token bonus selector (0/25/50/100/200 tokens) for surge registrations\n  - Animated banner preview showing exactly how it will look to players\n  - Syncs surgeEnabled, surgeThresholdPct, surgeMessage, surgeTokenBonus to store\n\nPANEL 3 — SponsorBidReviewPanel (src/components/to/SponsorBidReviewPanel.tsx)\n  - Table of pending/resolved sponsor bids per event\n  - Each row: logo, sponsor name, slot label, bid amount, bid type, timestamp, Accept/Reject actions\n  - Preview modal: mock bracket preview with animated placement (banner/overlay/MVP/ticker positions)\n  - Accept: fills slot, sends notification strip at panel top\n  - Reject: textarea modal for rejection reason, sent to sponsor\n  - Resolved bids collapsible section\n  - useToOpsStore (src/stores/toOps.ts): manages bid state + notifications with 4 mock bids\n\nPANEL 4 — PayoutSetupPanel (src/components/to/PayoutSetupPanel.tsx)\n  - 3-item compliance checklist: Bank Account Connected, Prize Pool Escrowed, W-9 on File\n  - Each item: ✓ (green) or ✗ (red) with description and action link\n  - All-clear message when all 3 pass; blocked message when any fail\n  - onReadyChange callback to gate publish button in CreateTournamentPage\n  - Wired into CreateTournamentPage before action buttons (only shown when prize pool > 0)\n  - Integrated publish gate: !hasPrizePool || payoutSetupReady\n\nWIRING\n  - TODashboard: new \"Event Ops Console\" section with tournament selector dropdown,\n    2-column grid (Escrow+Surge left, SponsorBids+PayoutSetup right)\n  - CreateTournamentPage: PayoutSetupPanel appears before publish when prize pool set;\n    fixed pre-existing bug: form.rules → rules\n\nTYPE EXTENSIONS (src/types/index.ts)\n  - Tournament: escrowBalance, escrowStatus, surgeEnabled, surgeThresholdPct,\n    surgeMessage, surgeTokenBonus, toPayoutSetup\n  - SponsorBid interface + SponsorBidStatus + SponsorBidType types\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMUtrHVh\n1/key7YtrtBhl7wPAWUFP4HGMje02rUYjDVBvIJb1z/zT0WGmcstK1qOCJbidv/8Q65MVRqWjtXj\nyQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T00:35:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/