type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/1644ef4461d1f9d37dfcbdbf13583f49b0594e1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T22:20:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T12:51:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add complete AEU payment integration frontend (Approvely + Dots)\n\nTASK 1 — PaymentIframeModal: Approvely checkout embedded in iframe modal\n  - Desktop: 480x600 centered modal with AEU header, security footer\n  - Mobile: full-screen iframe with minimal sticky header\n  - 5-second X-Frame-Options block detection with fallback UI\n  - postMessage listener for Approvely success/cancel events\n  - Sandbox-safe origin validation via VITE_APPROVELY_CHECKOUT_DOMAIN\n\nTASK 2 — SubscriptionCheckoutModal: 3-state flow (summary → iframe → success)\n  - Billing cycle toggle (monthly/6mo/annual) with savings callout\n  - Hardcoded final pricing: Player Gold $9.99/mo, TO Gold $29.99/mo, TO Platinum $97.99/mo\n  - Sandbox toast \"no charge will occur\", mock session URL generation\n  - Auto-redirect to /dashboard after 3s on success\n  - TODO comments for backend POST /api/payments/create-approvely-session\n\nTASK 3 — EntryFeeCheckoutModal: 3-state flow (options → iframe → success)\n  - Cash ($10) vs hybrid ($8 + 200 tokens) toggle with token balance validation\n  - Wallet impact preview (before/after balances)\n  - Disabled hybrid option with tooltip if insufficient tokens\n  - TODO comments for backend POST /api/payments/create-entry-session\n\nTASK 4 — PaymentReturnPage at /payment/return (iframe fallback path)\n  - Reads URL params: status, type, tournamentId, plan, session_id\n  - Always calls GET /api/payments/verify — never trusts URL status param\n  - 4 states: loading, success (subscription), success (entry), cancelled, error\n  - Reference session ID displayed for support\n\nTASK 5 — WithdrawalRequestPanel (Dots-backed)\n  - Available vs pending balance display\n  - Amount input with min $10 / max availableBalance validation\n  - W-9 amber warning at $550, hard block gate at $600\n  - KYC gate for unverified/pending identity status\n  - Payout method radio cards: ACH, PayPal (email), Venmo (handle), Check (≥$100)\n  - 1.5s mock submit with success toast, TODO for Dots API call\n\nTASK 6 — usePayments() hook\n  - Central state for subscription and entry modals\n  - initiateSubscription(), initiateEntryFee(), requestWithdrawal(), closeAllPaymentModals()\n  - Console logs intended backend calls for development tracing\n\nTASK 7 — PAYMENT_INTEGRATION.md + .env.example\n  - Full processor responsibility breakdown\n  - User flow diagrams for all 3 payment paths\n  - Required backend endpoint reference table\n  - Dots API endpoint reference (sandbox + production)\n  - iframe embedding confirmation checklist for Approvely\n  - Security rules (never trust frontend state, never expose API keys)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA","tree":{"sha":"622a95dd7112bbba0a87282fbbcc39b4277df736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/622a95dd7112bbba0a87282fbbcc39b4277df736"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/1644ef4461d1f9d37dfcbdbf13583f49b0594e1e","verification":{"payload":"tree 622a95dd7112bbba0a87282fbbcc39b4277df736\nparent 1e65336a889266bdf1b7ec507bae065d4feb59f2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772576449 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772628710 +0000\n\nAdd complete AEU payment integration frontend (Approvely + Dots)\n\nTASK 1 — PaymentIframeModal: Approvely checkout embedded in iframe modal\n  - Desktop: 480x600 centered modal with AEU header, security footer\n  - Mobile: full-screen iframe with minimal sticky header\n  - 5-second X-Frame-Options block detection with fallback UI\n  - postMessage listener for Approvely success/cancel events\n  - Sandbox-safe origin validation via VITE_APPROVELY_CHECKOUT_DOMAIN\n\nTASK 2 — SubscriptionCheckoutModal: 3-state flow (summary → iframe → success)\n  - Billing cycle toggle (monthly/6mo/annual) with savings callout\n  - Hardcoded final pricing: Player Gold $9.99/mo, TO Gold $29.99/mo, TO Platinum $97.99/mo\n  - Sandbox toast \"no charge will occur\", mock session URL generation\n  - Auto-redirect to /dashboard after 3s on success\n  - TODO comments for backend POST /api/payments/create-approvely-session\n\nTASK 3 — EntryFeeCheckoutModal: 3-state flow (options → iframe → success)\n  - Cash ($10) vs hybrid ($8 + 200 tokens) toggle with token balance validation\n  - Wallet impact preview (before/after balances)\n  - Disabled hybrid option with tooltip if insufficient tokens\n  - TODO comments for backend POST /api/payments/create-entry-session\n\nTASK 4 — PaymentReturnPage at /payment/return (iframe fallback path)\n  - Reads URL params: status, type, tournamentId, plan, session_id\n  - Always calls GET /api/payments/verify — never trusts URL status param\n  - 4 states: loading, success (subscription), success (entry), cancelled, error\n  - Reference session ID displayed for support\n\nTASK 5 — WithdrawalRequestPanel (Dots-backed)\n  - Available vs pending balance display\n  - Amount input with min $10 / max availableBalance validation\n  - W-9 amber warning at $550, hard block gate at $600\n  - KYC gate for unverified/pending identity status\n  - Payout method radio cards: ACH, PayPal (email), Venmo (handle), Check (≥$100)\n  - 1.5s mock submit with success toast, TODO for Dots API call\n\nTASK 6 — usePayments() hook\n  - Central state for subscription and entry modals\n  - initiateSubscription(), initiateEntryFee(), requestWithdrawal(), closeAllPaymentModals()\n  - Console logs intended backend calls for development tracing\n\nTASK 7 — PAYMENT_INTEGRATION.md + .env.example\n  - Full processor