glow animation\n\nStep 11 — Badge Unlock Animation:\n- Badge appears face-down (gray \"?\" placeholder)\n- After 600ms, CSS 3D flip animation reveals the badge icon\n- Shows badge name, rarity tag, description\n- \"Added to your collection\" confirmation\n\nStep 12 — Winnings Credited UI:\n- Animated slide-in card showing \"+$X.XX added to your wallet\"\n- Updated wallet balance card appears below\n- Only shown when prize money applies (win result)\n\nStep 13 — Withdraw or Reuse:\n- Two option cards: \"Withdraw Winnings\" → /wallet, \"Use for Next Tournament\" → /tournaments\n- Match summary row (XP earned, badges, winnings)\n- Close button to dismiss\n\nCSS additions: slideInUp, badgeFlip (3D perspective), rankUpPulse (gold glow),\nand countUp keyframe animations.\n\nFlow wiring: MatchDetailPage triggers PostMatchRewards 2s after result\nsubmission (simulating opponent confirmation), then transitions to completed\nstate on flow dismiss.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA","tree":{"sha":"73cb1851c87fb5fe9bb256f85a2ac6dca555c291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/73cb1851c87fb5fe9bb256f85a2ac6dca555c291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/9ad6b0f558814d5cd02c64dcc1d4003e7217d052","verification":{"payload":"tree 73cb1851c87fb5fe9bb256f85a2ac6dca555c291\nparent 599589afd282a652e6bdc105b79c2b5da2ef48fb\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772574920 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772628708 +0000\n\nAdd post-match rewards flow: XP animation, badge unlock, winnings, withdraw/reuse\n\nSteps 10–13 of the player match workflow, chained as a multi-step modal\noverlay that triggers after result submission:\n\nStep 10 — XP Gain Animation:\n- Shows XP bar at pre-match level, then animates fill to new amount after\n  500ms delay using setInterval (40 steps, 30ms each)\n- XP gained badge (+350 for win, +150 draw, +75 loss)\n- If XP triggers rank-up: gold celebration card with pulse glow animation\n\nStep 11 — Badge Unlock Animation:\n- Badge appears face-down (gray \"?\" placeholder)\n- After 600ms, CSS 3D flip animation reveals the badge icon\n- Shows badge name, rarity tag, description\n- \"Added to your collection\" confirmation\n\nStep 12 — Winnings Credited UI:\n- Animated slide-in card showing \"+$X.XX added to your wallet\"\n- Updated wallet balance card appears below\n- Only shown when prize money applies (win result)\n\nStep 13 — Withdraw or Reuse:\n- Two option cards: \"Withdraw Winnings\" → /wallet, \"Use for Next Tournament\" → /tournaments\n- Match summary row (XP earned, badges, winnings)\n- Close button to dismiss\n\nCSS additions: slideInUp, badgeFlip (3D perspective), rankUpPulse (gold glow),\nand countUp keyframe animations.\n\nFlow wiring: MatchDetailPage triggers PostMatchRewards 2s after result\nsubmission (simulating opponent confirmation), then transitions to completed\nstate on flow dismiss.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAc6+puO\ndZY1gxpCB+9+gOv39QFVU4HqbfyCWBZUmNisV6ArExUxch5lUPFXYUiCuDzkpWlup9rQerlugjEL\nuQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T00:35:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api