:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T12:49:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add useTournamentFeed hook and upgrade GameTicker with live feed infrastructure\n\nuseTournamentFeed (src/hooks/api/useTournamentFeed.ts):\n- Attempts SSE connection to /api/tournaments/feed on mount\n- If SSE does not open within 3s, closes and falls back to polling\n  /api/tournaments?status=live,upcoming every 30 seconds\n- Tracks connectionStatus: ''live'' | ''polling'' | ''offline''\n- Serves mockFeedData immediately in all paths so nothing breaks today\n- FeedTournament extends Tournament with fillRateChange15m and championGamertag\n- 5s demo timer transitions OW2 from ''live'' → ''completed'' to exercise the\n  ChampionAnnouncement path; remove when real SSE events arrive\n\nGameTicker (AppShell.tsx) — now driven by useTournamentFeed:\n- SurgeBadge subcomponent: \"🔥 FILLING FAST\" with animate-pulse when\n  fillRateChange15m > 0.10 (10% fill in 15 min)\n- TickerStatusBadge subcomponent: LIVE (green + pulsing dot) /\n  UPCOMING (gray) / DONE (muted) driven by tournament.status\n- Each ticker item is a <Link to=\"/tournaments/:id?tab=bracket\">\n- ChampionAnnouncement: detects status transitions to ''completed'' via\n  useRef/useEffect diff, replaces ticker with full-width gold banner for\n  60 seconds, then collapses; multiple champions queue (first shown first)\n- Connection status indicator: 1.5px dot in ticker left edge —\n  green = SSE live, amber = polling, red = offline\n- Custom event ticker (paid upgrade) path unchanged\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA","tree":{"sha":"6b50549e05b019d2b1e67dac6ffd456cc837ceb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/6b50549e05b019d2b1e67dac6ffd456cc837ceb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/0d76c27e509fcf0b2b4bdf2b989fe19da1bcfb7a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b50549e05b019d2b1e67dac6ffd456cc837ceb2\nparent d02df4d0487ed35284c70d390f955b76929418bc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772573152 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772628566 +0000\n\nAdd useTournamentFeed hook and upgrade GameTicker with live feed infrastructure\n\nuseTournamentFeed (src/hooks/api/useTournamentFeed.ts):\n- Attempts SSE connection to /api/tournaments/feed on mount\n- If SSE does not open within 3s, closes and falls back to polling\n  /api/tournaments?status=live,upcoming every 30 seconds\n- Tracks connectionStatus: ''live'' | ''polling'' | ''offline''\n- Serves mockFeedData immediately in all paths so nothing breaks today\n- FeedTournament extends Tournament with fillRateChange15m and championGamertag\n- 5s demo timer transitions OW2 from ''live'' → ''completed'' to exercise the\n  ChampionAnnouncement path; remove when real SSE events arrive\n\nGameTicker (AppShell.tsx) — now driven by useTournamentFeed:\n- SurgeBadge subcomponent: \"🔥 FILLING FAST\" with animate-pulse when\n  fillRateChange15m > 0.10 (10% fill in 15 min)\n- TickerStatusBadge subcomponent: LIVE (green + pulsing dot) /\n  UPCOMING (gray) / DONE (muted) driven by tournament.status\n- Each ticker item is a <Link to=\"/tournaments/:id?tab=bracket\">\n- ChampionAnnouncement: detects status transitions to ''completed'' via\n  useRef/useEffect diff, replaces ticker with full-width gold banner for\n  60 seconds, then collapses; multiple champions queue (first shown first)\n- Connection status indicator: 1.5px dot in ticker left edge —\n  green = SSE live, amber = polling, red = offline\n- Custom event ticker (paid upgrade) path unchanged\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKt7l/XH\nMvNmInBXnC4+mZnrMu6Xtos2nfLSEMpqpkBGOiO4ejLBT+tVjKY4td3iK1xObS2D8OmSjX4ERcrV\nuwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T00:35:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commit/0d76c27e509fcf0b2b4bdf2b989fe19da1bcfb7a","node_id":"C_kwDORgdiJNoAKDBkNzZjMjdlNTA5ZmNmMGIyYjRiZGYyYjk4OWZlMTlkYTFiY2ZiN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commit/d02df4d0487ed35284c70d390f955b76929418bc","sha":"d02df4d0487ed35284c70d390f955b76929418bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/d02df4d0487ed35284c70d390f955b76929418bc"}],"sha":"0d76c27e509fcf0b2b4bdf2b989fe19da1bcfb7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/0d76c27e509fcf0b2b4bdf2b989fe19da1bcfb7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/d02df4d0487ed35284c70d390f955b76929418bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T21:11:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T12:49:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add PageHeader, SectionHeader, CardHeader, CardBody, CardList layout components\n\nNew exports in src/components/ui/index.tsx:\n- PageHeader: title, subtitle, actions[] (renders Button per variant), optional\n  back chevron that calls navigate(-1) for nested routes\n- SectionHeader: title + optional viewAllLink renders \"View All →\" link\n- CardHeader: title, optional badge pill, optional action ReactNode slot\n- CardBody: consistent px-4 py-3 wrapper div with className override\n- CardList: space-y-3 vertical stack, className override for tighter gaps\n\nUpdated two PlayerDashboard panels as examples:\n- MyTournamentsPanel: inline header + div → CardHeader (action slot) + CardList\n- NewsFeedWidget: inline header + div → CardHeader (action slot) + CardList (space-y-1)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA","tree":{"sha":"a8a1994446ae46eac25f7c3c03347f8bd198b1f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/a8a1994446ae46eac25f7c3c03347f8bd198b1f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU