pe":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/bafb9f2eff50c876012e111a418d800681e3fa8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T21:07:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T12:48:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add CTA component system (P0–P3 tiers, CTAButton, CountdownTimer, CTADisplay)\n\n- CountdownTimer: ticking countdown from ISO timestamp, onExpire callback,\n  animate-pulse at ≤60s, h:mm:ss / m:ss format, tabular-nums\n- CTAButton: priority-tier-driven styles (P0 red, P1 amber, P2 blue, P3 gray),\n  renders as <Link> when `to` prop is provided, otherwise <button>\n- P0CTACard: full-width blocking takeover, z-indexed overlay, red gradient strip,\n  no dismiss, optional CountdownTimer, role=alertdialog aria-live=assertive\n- P1CTACard: amber contextual inline card, dismissable, secondary action support\n- P2CTABanner: blue slim horizontal banner, dismissable, secondary dismiss label\n- P3CTACard: gray/neutral compact engagement card, dismissable\n- CTADisplay: composite — reads activeRole from auth store, open CTAs from\n  CTAStore, renders correct tier card; supports `tiers` filter and `showAll`\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA","tree":{"sha":"7a81ac21a17184ede057f109c3a3fc6706f84137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/7a81ac21a17184ede057f109c3a3fc6706f84137"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/bafb9f2eff50c876012e111a418d800681e3fa8d","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a81ac21a17184ede057f109c3a3fc6706f84137\nparent f217de4a6e931746b9313aaeab4f60893cff3970\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772572053 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772628539 +0000\n\nAdd CTA component system (P0–P3 tiers, CTAButton, CountdownTimer, CTADisplay)\n\n- CountdownTimer: ticking countdown