2026-03-04T12:48:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add Zod schemas, React Query hooks, and migrate 2 forms to react-hook-form\n\nSchemas (src/schemas/):\n- auth.ts — loginSchema, registrationSchema (field + cross-field validation)\n- tournament.ts — createTournamentSchema (future-date refine)\n- team.ts — createTeamSchema (tag transform to uppercase)\n- score.ts — scoreReportSchema\n- wallet.ts — withdrawalSchema\n- index.ts — barrel export\n\nReact Query hooks (src/hooks/api/):\n- useMe — returns current user from auth store\n- useTournaments / useTournament / useBracket — wraps api/tournaments\n- useTeams / useTeam / useMyTeams — wraps api/teams\n- useWallet — mock transaction history + live balance from store\n- useNotifications — mock notification list\n- index.ts — barrel export\n\nForm migrations:\n- LoginPage: both sign-in and sign-up forms use useForm + zodResolver;\n  removes 9 useState calls; business-logic errors (rate limit) kept as\n  component state; password strength driven by watch(''password'')\n- CreateTournamentPage: text/number/date/url/select fields registered with\n  RHF; complex UI state (sponsorships, rules, toggles) kept as useState;\n  handlePublish replaced with handleSubmit(onPublish) so Zod validates\n  before the tournament is created\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA","tree":{"sha":"fb0384b9209991ca2bbe04b0b7848bb99ecfebeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/fb0384b9209991ca2bbe04b0b7848bb99ecfebeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/f217de4a6e931746b9313aaeab4f60893cff3970","verification":{"payload":"tree fb0384b9209991ca2bbe04b0b7848bb99ecfebeb\nparent 5b569bcb3a8e5ee8d5c0540c34a7c0546a75fb70\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772571566 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772628516 +0000\n\nAdd Zod schemas, React Query hooks, and migrate 2 forms to react-hook-form\n\nSchemas (src/schemas/):\n- auth.ts — loginSchema, registrationSchema (field + cross-field validation)\n- tournament.ts — createTournamentSchema (future-date refine)\n- team.ts — createTeamSchema (tag transform to uppercase)\n- score.ts — scoreReportSchema\n- wallet.ts — withdrawalSchema\n- index.ts — barrel export\n\nReact Query hooks (src/hooks/api/):\n- useMe — returns current user from auth store\n- useTournaments / useTournament / useBracket — wraps api/tournaments\n- useTeams / useTeam / useMyTeams — wraps api/teams\n- useWallet — mock transaction history + live balance from store\n- useNotifications — mock notification list\n- index.ts — barrel export\n\nForm migrations:\n- LoginPage: both sign-in and sign-up forms use useForm + zodResolver;\n  removes 9 useState calls; business-logic errors (rate limit) kept as\n  component state; password strength driven by watch(''password'')\n- CreateTournamentPage: text/number/date/url/select fields registered with\n  RHF; complex UI state (sponsorships, rules, toggles) kept as useState;\n  handlePublish replaced with handleSubmit(onPublish) so Zod validates\n  before the tournament is created\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011o9A7JymkW9FqkkCKdBUuA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI8f//Kn\nHENKSZcx/wOHkJCHTI8AMrc2dw0FehvWs/CKVG88ShfgSOdv3FAcksld8IWT45IToF+tl/2QrD/Q\nrwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T00:35:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co