"AEUMVPs","node_id":"U_kgDODAt4lg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/e3ea5d713227e77e33b3e1365f800cdfea42cffc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T02:43:34Z","email":"jtaylor@aeu.gg","name":"AEUMVPs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T02:43:34Z","email":"jtaylor@aeu.gg","name":"AEUMVPs"},"message":"feat(backend): Layer 2  wallets, payments, and compliance\n\nNew Models (Prisma):\n- Wallet (usdBalance, pendingBalance, tokenBalance, lifetimeEarnings)\n- WalletTransaction (type, amount, tokenAmount, status, referenceId)\n- PayoutRequest (amount, method, destination, dotsPayoutId, status)\n- W9Submission (status, submittedAt, reviewedAt)\n\nNew Enums:\n- TransactionType (DEPOSIT, ENTRY_FEE, PRIZE, PAYOUT, etc.)\n- TransactionStatus (PENDING, COMPLETED, FAILED, REVERSED)\n- PayoutMethod (ACH, PAYPAL, VENMO, CHECK)\n- PayoutStatus (PENDING, PROCESSING, COMPLETED, FAILED)\n- W9Status (PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED)\n- Added BRONZE/SILVER to MembershipTier\n\nEndpoints:\n- GET/POST /api/wallet (balance, transactions, add-funds)\n- POST/GET /api/payouts (request, history) - with KYC/W9 validation\n- POST /api/webhooks/dots, /api/webhooks/approvely\n- POST /api/payments/* (create-approvely-session, create-entry-session, verify)\n- POST/GET /api/compliance (submit-w9, status)\n\nIntegrations:\n- Dots API (sandbox mock) for payouts\n- Approvely (mock) for payment sessions\n- Webhook handlers for both\n\nConfig:\n- Added DOTS_APP_ID, DOTS_API_KEY, DOTS_BASE_URL\n- Added APPROVELY_SECRET_KEY\n- Added WALLET_CONSTANTS (W9_THRESHOLD_USD, MIN/MAX_PAYOUT_USD)\n\nAll endpoints tested and working.","tree":{"sha":"d15e9518b68749146d820955808945468e7fabbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/d15e9518b68749146d820955808945468e7fabbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/e3ea5d713227e77e33b3e1365f800cdfea42cffc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202078358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs","id":202078358,"login":"AEUMVPs","node_id":"U_kgDODAt4lg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commit/e3ea5d713227e77e33b3e1365f800cdfea42cffc","node_id":"C_kwDORgdiJNoAKGUzZWE1ZDcxMzIyN2U3N2UzM2IzZTEzNjVmODAwY2RmZWE0MmNmZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commit/d28bc834a19a57c8af5c7ae3b3c38fd607efb46e","sha":"d28bc834a19a57c8af5c7ae3b3c38fd607efb46e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/d28bc834a19a57c8af5c7ae3b3c38fd607efb46e"}],"sha":"e3ea5d713227e77e33b3e1365f800cdfea42cffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/e3ea5d713227e77e33b3e1365f800cdfea42cffc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202078358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs","id":202078358,"login":"AEUMVPs","node_id":"U_kgDODAt4lg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/d28bc834a19a57c8af5c7ae3b3c38fd607efb46e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T01:11:29Z","email":"jtaylor@aeu.gg","name":"AEUMVPs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T01:11:29Z","email":"jtaylor@aeu.gg","name":"AEUMVPs"},"message":"feat: Layer 1 backend  Express/Prisma auth API with PostgreSQL\n\nBackend (/backend):\n- Express 4 + TypeScript (strict, ES2020) + Prisma ORM\n- PostgreSQL schema: User + RefreshToken models\n- Enums: Role, MembershipTier, KYCStatus\n- Auth endpoints: register, login, refresh, logout, me, resend-verification, verify-email\n- JWT (15min access) + refresh token rotation (30d, stored in DB)\n- bcrypt password hashing (12 rounds)\n- Zod request validation\n- Rate limiting on auth routes (10 req/min/IP)\n- CORS restricted to FRONTEND_URL\n- Helmet security headers\n- Consistent error handling (Zod 400, Prisma P2002 409, JWT 401)\n- Health check: GET /api/health with DB connectivity check\n- nodemon + ts-node dev workflow\n\nAll endpoints tested and verified against local PostgreSQL 16.","tree":{"sha":"85092b59995f7f48aa024ade42b7d387045bff51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/85092b59995f7f48aa024ade42b7d387045bff51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/d28bc834a19a57c8af5c7ae3b3c38fd607efb46e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202078358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs","id":202078358,"login":"AEUMVPs","node_id":"U_kgDODAt4lg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commit/d28bc834a19a57c8af5c7ae3b3c38fd607efb46e","node_id":"C_kwDORgdiJNoAKGQyOGJjODM0YTE5YTU3YzhhZjVjN2FlM2IzYzM4ZmQ2MDdlZmI0NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commit/3367558dab6b9645c92fc8de88f1810a452b4640","sha":"3367558dab6b9645c92fc8de88f1810a452b4640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commits/3367558dab