\nAWS deployment (aws/):\n- setup-ec2.sh: Amazon Linux 2023 provisioning (Node 22, nginx, certbot)\n- setup-rds.sh: PostgreSQL 16 RDS instance creation\n- nginx reverse proxy config with SSL for api.aeu.gg\n- systemd service unit for process management\n\nFrontend API layer:\n- Rewrote all 7 API modules from mock implementations to real axios calls\n- Removed mockDelay helper, standardized named exports\n- Added .env.production (api.aeu.gg) and .env.development (localhost:4000)","tree":{"sha":"24ac35532041f7c834bd976f052e8f67e86b2e80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/24ac35532041f7c834bd976f052e8f67e86b2e80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/3367558dab6b9645c92fc8de88f1810a452b4640","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202078358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs","id":202078358,"login":"AEUMVPs","node_id":"U_kgDODAt4lg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/commit/3367558dab6b9645c92fc8de88f1810a452b4640","node_id":"C_kwDORgdiJNoAKDMzNjc1NThkYWI2Yjk2NDVjOTJmYzhkZTg4ZjE