,"message":"Granular CRM-controlled affiliate commission rules engine\n\n- AffiliateCommissionRule type: per-product-variant rates (membership tiers, custom tickers, tournament entries, marketplace listings)\n- AffiliateTierPermission type: per-membership-tier affiliate permissions (max codes, commission multiplier, promotion access, min payout)\n- computeEffectiveRates: centralized rule lookup  tier permissions  affiliate overrides\n- CRM Panel: 5 tabs (Affiliates, Commission Rules, Tier Permissions, Conversions, Payouts)\n- CRM Commission Rules tab: editable rules per product type with enable/disable, add/delete, min tier controls\n- CRM Tier Permissions tab: editable tier settings (multiplier, max codes, enrollment, payout threshold)\n- SubscriptionsPage: uses getEffectiveRates for dynamic discount/commission based on product variant\n- AffiliatePage: shows full product commission table per user tier with Active/Locked status\n- 9 default rules covering all membership variants + all asset types","tree":{"sha":"fe6b1532c0ea6d3d64bb47c0bdb5755fa714b693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/trees/fe6b1532c0ea6d3d64bb47c0bdb5755fa714b693"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AEUMVPs/MVPSPROJECTCOPY-AEU-SITE-/git/commits/c762ee5e9acbcd3b186f833b54b9a6fe4f251f7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202078358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AEUMVPs","id":202078358,"login":"AEUMVPs","node_id":"U_kgDODAt4lg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AEUMVPs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g