_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/commits/042f81587b150f99a2a6f3668888ab8380620a0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T20:03:42Z","email":"denis.ermilov@gmail.com","name":"eiler2005"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T20:03:42Z","email":"denis.ermilov@gmail.com","name":"eiler2005"},"message":"docs: add full enterprise PRD with vision, personas, journeys, requirements\n\nNew docs/PRD.md (13 sections, 5 Mermaid diagrams):\n- Executive summary and 18-month outcome targets\n- Problem & market context, why-now\n- Four personas (Mira / Roman / Petra / Carla) owning each surface\n- Vision, positioning vs Klarna/in-house/bank, differentiators\n- Five end-to-end user journeys with sequence + flowchart diagrams\n  and per-journey acceptance criteria\n- Functional requirements module-by-module mapped to src/App.tsx routes\n- Non-functional requirements (perf, security, compliance, a11y,\n  i18n, observability, operations) with concrete budgets\n- North-Star metric, module-level KPIs with Phase-1 and GA+6 targets,\n  counter-metrics\n- v1 GA acceptance criteria checklist\n- Six prioritized risks with mitigations\n- Four-phase delivery roadmap (Prototype shipped to Expansion 2027+)\n- Five open questions with owners and decision deadlines\n- BNPL/fintech glossary\n\nREADME.md updated: ''Architecture notes'' block now links both\nARCHITECTURE.md (HOW) and PRD.md (WHAT/WHY); ''Project structure''\ntree shows docs/PRD.md.\n\nCHANGELOG.md updated: [Unreleased] split into ''Added'' (PRD) and\n''Roadmap'' (existing items).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac7b7e242e9a4706e97fa16c43e786e4dd2dbf48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/git/trees/ac7b7e242e9a4706e97fa16c43e786e4dd2dbf48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/git/commits/042f81587b150f99a2a6f3668888ab8380620a0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45200491?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eiler2005","id":45200491,"login":"eiler2005","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjAwNDkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/commit/042f81587b150f99a2a6f3668888ab8380620a0c","node_id":"C_kwDORgxZ5toAKDA0MmY4MTU4N2IxNTBmOTlhMmE2ZjM2Njg4ODhhYjgzODA2MjBhMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/commit/faf8b0bfc37c3f481003c3797f852e1f33bc72f7","sha":"faf8b0bfc37c3f481003c3797f852e1f33bc72f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/commits/faf8b0bfc37c3f481003c3797f852e1f33bc72f7"}],"sha":"042f81587b150f99a2a6f3668888ab8380620a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/commits/042f81587b150f99a2a6f3668888ab8380620a0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45200491?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eiler2005","id":45200491,"login":"eiler2005","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjAwNDkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/commits/faf8b0bfc37c3f481003c3797f852e1f33bc72f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T14:43:55Z","email":"denis.ermilov@gmail.com","name":"eiler2005"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T14:43:55Z","email":"denis.ermilov@gmail.com","name":"eiler2005"},"message":"docs: rewrite README and add LICENSE, CONTRIBUTING, SECURITY, architecture, CI\n\nDocumentation overhaul to make the repo readable and review-ready\nwithout changing application behavior.\n\nAdded:\n- README.md (rewritten from the default Lovable template) — overview,\n  per-module breakdown, tech stack, project structure, getting\n  started, env vars, architecture notes, roadmap, demo guide,\n  module previews, footer credits\n- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md — full architectural write-up with two Mermaid\n  diagrams (system + routing tree), module breakdown, shared shell,\n  design system, state/data, build pipeline, conventions, debt\n- docs/screenshots/{seller,admin,customer}.png — placeholder previews\n  referenced from the README, plus a README explaining how to swap\n  them for real captures\n- CHANGELOG.md — Keep a Changelog format with [Unreleased] +\n  [0.1.0] entry\n- LICENSE — MIT\n- CONTRIBUTING.md — branching, Conventional Commits, code style,\n  PR checklist\n- SECURITY.md — private disclosure policy and SLAs\n- .env.example — documents VITE_POSTHOG_KEY and VITE_POSTHOG_HOST\n- .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md — typed PR checklist\n- .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/{bug_report,feature_request,config}.yml —\n  YAML form templates with blank-issues disabled\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml — lint + tsc --noEmit + build on every\n  PR and push to main, with npm cache and concurrency control\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0ebf2dbd0513afac079bc1124d83978f180f6bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/git/trees/a0ebf2dbd0513afac079bc1124d83978f180f6bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/git/commits/faf8b0bfc37c3f481003c3797f852e1f33bc72f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45200491?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eiler2005","id":45200491,"login":"eiler2005","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjAwNDkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eiler2005/repos","site_admin":false,"s