der, new Halal templates, and analytics filters for Shariah plans with risk/AI insights.\n- Seller Portal Store Management / Support: badges and risk indicators for Shariah-enabled stores and updated support notes.\n- Customer App / Risk Cockpit: placeholder Shariah risk enhancements and badges.\n- Ensured design aligns with existing fintech UI (minimal McKinsey/Stripe-like, purple accents) and all content remains in English with USD amounts.\n\nX-Lovable-Edit-ID: edt-d3aa33d2-da92-4de3-aabc-e14652a446d1","tree":{"sha":"08322a0a556ad08c725305aeb67f5630e93fc3a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/git/trees/08322a0a556ad08c725305aeb67f5630e93fc3a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eiler2005/bnpl-flexipay-hub/git/commits/50d57a27ba9d42416278b4864a45ab56093fe2fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/818760?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/lovable-dev","id":159125892,"login":"lovable-dev[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCXwRhA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http