ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/commits/c692ed0a589a95390489c73420e40236d3ca8b5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:57:31Z","email":"jeasmith@me.com","name":"Jamie Smith"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:57:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: decide Radar''s credential inventory and trust boundary (#120)\n\n* docs: decide Radar''s credential inventory and trust boundary\n\nAnswer record for #94. Workflow secrets move to a main-only\nradar-production GitHub Environment; the bridge feed URL becomes a\nsecret referenced by name; the app reads with radar_public everywhere\nwithout the Neon integration; radar_migrate is never stored; the export\ngets a read-only role and a deploy key; Actions output is treated as\npublic; writers share a queued concurrency group.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: address review on the Radar credential inventory\n\nName private run records in the export role''s leak impact, inventory\nthe bridge inbox address with its paired rotation, state where the\nrepository OAuth token reaches, and stop presenting queue: max as an\nordering guarantee.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f44bdf9657ef1e02f3c54539e939144099993886","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/trees/f44bdf9657ef1e02f3c54539e939144099993886"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/commits/c692ed0a589a95390489c73420e40236d3ca8b5d","verification":{"payload":"tree f44bdf9657ef1e02f3c54539e939144099993886\nparent 04956a1c2b3c33efc6dcdd8988ca78eea0da0ed8\nauthor Jamie Smith <jeasmith@me.com> 1789369051 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789369051 +0100\n\ndocs: decide Radar''s credential inventory and trust boundary (#120)\n\n* docs: d