,"html_url":"https://github.com/jeasmith/ithilien/commit/04956a1c2b3c33efc6dcdd8988ca78eea0da0ed8","node_id":"C_kwDORgzHydoAKDA0OTU2YTFjMmIzYzMzZWZjNmRjZGQ4OTg4Y2E3OGVlYTBkYTBlZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeasmith/ithilien/commit/dd7e07a042a7f971eec136bc1cc41872eb7b989c","sha":"dd7e07a042a7f971eec136bc1cc41872eb7b989c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/commits/dd7e07a042a7f971eec136bc1cc41872eb7b989c"}],"sha":"04956a1c2b3c33efc6dcdd8988ca78eea0da0ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/commits/04956a1c2b3c33efc6dcdd8988ca78eea0da0ed8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6818323?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeasmith","id":6818323,"login":"jeasmith","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTgzMjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeasmith","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/commits/dd7e07a042a7f971eec136bc1cc41872eb7b989c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:16:13Z","email":"jeasmith@me.com","name":"Jamie Smith"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:16:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"deps: bring dependencies up to date and hold TS 7 / @types/node 26 (#118)\n\nConsolidates the open Dependabot PRs into one verified update:\n\n- next 16.3.1 -> 16.3.5; react, react-dom, @types/react, @types/react-dom\n  19.2.x -> 19.3.0\n- vitest and @vitest/coverage-v8 4.1.11 -> 5.0.0 (moved together, as the\n  coverage provider pins the vitest version); vite 8.2 -> 8.3;\n  @vitejs/plugin-react 6.1.1; @testing-library/react 16.3.3;\n  @testing-library/user-event 14.6.7\n- oxlint 1.80 -> 1.82; shadcn 4.21; @base-ui/react 1.8; tailwind-merge 3.7\n- @types/node 24.13.4 (latest 24.x)\n- anthropics/claude-code-action 1.0.210 -> 1.0.216 (SHA verified against\n  the v1.0.216 tag)\n\nDeliberately not taken, with Dependabot ignore rules added so they stop\nrecurring weekly:\n\n- typescript 7: ADR-0012 pins TypeScript 6; a 7 upgrade is an\n  ecosystem-wide decision that needs its own ADR.\n- @types/node 26: the runtime is pinned to Node 24 in .nvmrc, engines.node\n  and the Dockerfile, and the types should track it.\n\npnpm validate, pnpm build and pnpm test:coverage all pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"161edd5198ab44c8c27d14ab872a49179f22f11e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/trees/161edd5198ab44c8c27d14ab872a49179f22f11e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/commits/dd7e07a042a7f971eec136bc1cc41872eb7b989c","verification":{"payload":"tree 161edd5198ab44c8c27d14ab872a49179f22f11e\nparent e78ef9d098b3d362ab05e00206fad5e78df09f2d\nauthor Jamie Smith <jeasmith@me.com> 1789323373 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789323373 +0100\n\ndeps: bring dependencies up to date and hold TS 7 / @types/node 26 (#118)\n\nConsolidates the open Dependabot PRs into one verified update:\n\n- next 16.3.1 -> 16.3.5; react, react-dom, @types/react, @types/react-dom\n  19.2.x -> 19.3.0\n- vitest and @vitest/coverage-v8 4.1.11 -> 5.0.0 (moved together, as the\n  coverage provider pins the vitest version); vite 8.2 -> 8.3;\n  @vitejs/plugin-react 6.1.1; @testing-library/react 16.3.3;\n  @testing-library/user-event 14.6.7\n- oxlint 1.80 -> 1.82; shadcn 4.21; @base-ui/react 1.8; tailwind-merge 3.7\n- @types/node 24.13.4 (latest 24.x)\n- anthropics/claude-code-action 1.0.210 -> 1.0.216 (SHA verified against\n  the v1.0.216 tag)\n\nDeliberately not taken, with Dependabot ignore rules added so they stop\nrecurring weekly:\n\n- typescript 7: ADR-0012 pins TypeScript 6; a 7 upgrade is an\n  ecosystem-wide decision that needs its own ADR.\n- @types/node 26: the runtime is pinned to Node 24 in .nvmrc, engines.node\n  and the Dockerfile, and the types should track it.\n\npnpm validate, pnpm build and pnpm test:coverage all pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpuhtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANfsQAHN+Okhiqplt+ZYjBqb3TyeP\n2nw0ycJDKrdU3wpUbmi6oVAn9gyX6AXGyd3OROY+/eHs82R8I+Eqf4JqjbI22ko5\nNe8iR29iUEdTteOp+Uw7t1Y9kX8/pK2VB4XyRLPVTZtYy6psRk2nSOd4CAoEFd3u\nzQdRpJjW4+mCHwWVkR6kfHDWtMtk8gi9/JyD0dELKlSQtc3kvTRWjefTNGl3kFM5\n6yko93SxkpbnLO9gF98sVcBlfaujI/+Uuo6Bv1FVPBGMVs0tkkd2TF4c6jgOGf/r\ngG7DTmjHJT0jXLRuGnmK8wD1eZT53LilcVhKCbhaNH4lJ/4vzOMfETfbuC+kqeNR\nYjpo9LYmaBhCAUG1C2n7Olv3NP4WFpfXPpFwii8maHPG7DnK2uRw98QTJa1vZu7q\nTNXxUvL4w4gisZgv6jTpoL74XvX/7rjSt3pAkVdxmN4+3+khSBYup+FkoVoy7p89\nMa3XrRQWsgmZZNQB0lvIBfb9Zg9OIaSyJ5aVfQeViktDr0+KESq7iWZrUA2MVWzA\n81YkoPacsVITI+kB0wVSg0xheJm1kLDSeIOJTjx9hDrMLM/8m3ocsEC7y/7avj7n\nxco/sG54NnGiGXtmPS71rGl3odOByodeiRUV7sd3wk8I6qG+xfWrDvwC+D4a0uRN\nN1I60n7XC6emAqVvRoto\n=Gr6t\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T18:16:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":1986444