{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:39:31Z","email":"jeasmith@me.com","name":"Jamie Smith"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T07:39:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: record the #98 revalidation probe findings (#102)\n\nOn-demand revalidation triggered against the shared production origin reaches\nthe Radar deployment; the shared origin serves regenerated content ~3s later.\n\nMeasured on production, because both Vercel projects use\nssoProtection: all_except_custom_domains and every *.vercel.app URL - preview\nand Radar''s own production deployment URL alike - answers an unauthenticated\nrequest with a 302 to the SSO endpoint. The custom domain is the only reachable\nsurface, which makes calling the shared origin forced rather than advisable.\n\nUnblocks #91. Three seconds also lets #97 revalidate and then verify.","tree":{"sha":"6df76897b4260b9833eeff8e98e9decc60e8234b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/trees/6df76897b4260b9833eeff8e98e9decc60e8234b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/commits/3d994e4ee05fa15606d9ae54c8060db91f7838d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 6df76897b4260b9833eeff8e98e9decc60e8234b\nparent c1310a84a3efe273d4c1d61b8e403b08678c9d5a\nauthor Jamie Smith <jeasmith@me.com> 1788334771 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788334771 +0100\n\ndocs: record the #98 revalidation probe findings (#102)\n\nOn-demand revalidation triggered against the shared production origin reaches\nthe Radar deployment; the shared origin serves regenerated content ~3s later.\n\nMeasured on production, because both Vercel projects use\nssoProtection: all_except_custom_domains and every *.vercel.app URL - preview\nand Radar''s own production deployment URL alike - answers an unauthenticated\nrequest with a 302 to the SSO endpoint. The custom domain is the only reachable\nsurface, which makes calling the shared origin forced rather than advisable.\n\nUnblocks #91. Three seconds also lets #97 revalidate and then verify.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql9KzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAsYQABcWaDO6j/PDdxO/M1K6W16B\n0fJkzkohhU3epWHBWeaTQGNIFG9hlkT9dB3laBqGhiPuusrdKLAzU6RBrwEgsXou\n98NAmnDsehPq4y79AiY31A+Gv5aT6oBHeD1CWBRP4Jqo3Mn8N7wos2J2UAkeBv5o\no3w5w0Eo4YMKE3M7T/FJMVuh+PtDY+74TEJETBXwfQdHpMnuxvDUB3MrhK2P4TV0\nITFfEyA4bI2o2ueyvmD9bEwrpGrYxQLIhVyKEfih07wM1meG38Qytgo/OD2TPlip\n+zgM64FU97q5cTxMHy6bocPnS7THw3pXybVSotFfT/Nq8gjsLwrKtffS2jdk7HuV\ndWr//h2RSNhDgBhzwNKQ8V3y4WI9glsftmXPB6QLV9wuepcpy9QgCVGVeKbY1v/c\ntNrB1Y1YlO2DYd61CPbVuIFTqjt2B32BbhirUQhCBxdkasVtsYQe2oeqzRg+gTuj\n5ECgofVTaYa7fGGbuuCySGfcYJFzrbxYidST78Spvu9GQIIySDUxBOn1kilO7+0E\nuuoba6F6OLYksREE3NeimOVvFAM27z/WVRKK1F5BqIXKvBn9jF6bxtb1Jc66Gssd\n78jRN1FomOkzUfndZIZr6N18APHIaqE0l4L92UYOPbwueMlrH+dtiyQMd8EURxWm\n009Z+SlpYCI9fvW3pVX4\n=vWWA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T07:39:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeasmith/ithilien/commit/3d994e4ee05fa15606d9ae54c8060db91f7838d1","no