l":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/commits/78251d22892d27c317111e888522cd7e652b4666/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T09:55:58Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T09:55:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: bump anthropics/claude-code-action in the github-actions group (#81)\n\nBumps the github-actions group with 1 update: [anthropics/claude-code-action](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-action).\n\n\nUpdates `anthropics/claude-code-action` from 1.0.206 to 1.0.210\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-action/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-action/compare/1f291e1cfe0f5fc21db2aef19af844591600ade7...a874e9ecd7bb36efdad65429c6b35815f5a08f10)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: anthropics/claude-code-action\n  dependency-version: 1.0.210\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: github-actions\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed4b67d612c2f5f2ace2c3bc01f6390981c9d67c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/trees/ed4b67d612c2f5f2ace2c3bc01f6390981c9d67c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/commits/78251d22892d27c317111e888522cd7e652b4666","verification":{"payload":"tree ed4b67d612c2f5f2ace2c3bc01f6390981c9d67c\nparent db2a6bbcb38c836ec63bda1d64dbe49ff7e2318d\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1788170158 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788170158 +0100\n\nci: bump anthropics/claude-code-action in the github-actions group (#81)\n\nBumps the github-actions group with 1 u