 16.3.1\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commits/v16.3.1/packages/eslint-config-next)\n\nUpdates `vitest` from 4.1.10 to 4.1.11\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/blob/main/docs/releases.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/commits/v4.1.11/packages/vitest)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: eslint-config-next\n  dependency-version: 16.3.1\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: dev-dependencies\n- dependency-name: vitest\n  dependency-version: 4.1.11\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: dev-dependencies\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc37d87edd33283a7751e97c9298a1a450a4cda7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/trees/cc37d87edd33283a7751e97c9298a1a450a4cda7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeasmith/ithilien/git/commits/140f19718b28a04fd00739c7a5d95f7eb1e75a3d","verification":{"payload":"tree cc37d87edd33283a7751e97c9298a1a450a4cda7\nparent e22f25e74be66d78dce3db804d96710b7549a18a\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1787493801 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787493801 +0100\n\ndeps(dev): bump the dev-dependencies group across 1 directory with 2 updates (#73)\n\nBumps the dev-dependencies group with 2 updates in the / directory: [eslint-config-next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/tree/HEAD/packages/eslint-config-next) and [vitest](https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/tree/HEAD/packages/vitest).\n\n\nUpdates `eslint-config-next` from 16.3.0 to 16.3.1\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/n