":"2026-08-26T21:06:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Dependencies: Update all non-major dependencies (#209)\n\n* Dependencies: Update all non-major dependencies\n\n* Match the server build image to the bumped go directive\n\nThis branch raises the go directive to 1.27.0, which the golang:1.26-alpine\nbuild stage cannot satisfy, so `go mod download` fails and takes the image\nbuild, the e2e stack, and CodeQL''s autobuild with it.\n\n* Match the Playwright runner image to the bumped test runner\n\nThe image tag carries the preinstalled browsers, so bumping @playwright/test\nto 1.62.1 without it left the runner looking for chromium-1234, firefox-1538,\nand webkit-2336 in an image that ships 1228, 1532, and 2311.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Maximilian Rapp <maximilian.rapp@tum.de>","tree":{"sha":"f7f5e02a9ad576e833cce981c8a95c5c4a3bf25f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-intro-course/git/trees/f7f5e02a9ad576e833cce981c8a95c5c4a3bf25f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt-intro-course/git/commits/814dab08fb34e9203ee86925db7ebc3bac0a8fe1","verification":{"payload":"tree f7f5e02a9ad576e833cce981c8a95c5c4a3bf25f\nparent 40be1cd062158b46e668d8021cda646c5bc0655c\nauthor renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1787778412 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787778412 +0000\n\nDependencies: Update all non-major dependencies (#209)\n\n* Dependencies: Update all non-major dependencies\n\n* Match the server build image to the bumped go directive\n\nThis branch raises the go directive to 1.27.0, which the golang:1.26-alpine\nbuild stage cannot satisfy, so `go mod download` fails and takes the image\nbuild, the e2e stack, and CodeQL''s autobuild with it.\n\n* Match the Playwright runner image to the bumped test runner\n\nThe image tag carries the preinstalled browsers, so bumping @playwright/test\nto 