ng","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/1a33ccc1a098c0dec7f6e6ceaa3129b68333d844/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:42:36Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:42:36Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"roulette: move the League Mode card from the Teams tab to the League tab\n\nHow teams get assigned is a league level setting, so it belongs with the\nentry fee rather than on Teams, which is about who holds which franchise.\n\nExtracts the section into a self-contained LeagueModeCard in\ncomponents/LeagueMode.tsx that owns its own modal state and write, so the\nhost tab just drops it in. Restyled to match the League tab''s Card plus\ninner panel pattern, with the same Edit-style affordance the league name\nuses. Behavior is unchanged: editable during recruiting and assigned, an\nitalic locked note at in_season and complete, and the confirmation step when\nteams are already distributed.\n\nTeamsTab keeps the reshuffle button and loses the mode state, handler,\nmodal mount and section component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b8ba4ccc01d17c4c467f6feabd91bcf8c975115","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/3b8ba4ccc01d17c4c467f6feabd91bcf8c975115"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/1a33ccc1a098c0dec7f6e6ceaa3129b68333d844","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/1a33ccc1a098c0dec7f6e6ceaa3129b68333d844","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDFhMzNjY2MxYTA5OGMwZGVjN2Y2ZTZjZWFhMzEyOWI2ODMzM2Q4NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2","sha":"8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2"}],"sha":"1a33ccc1a098c0dec7f6e6ceaa3129b68333d844","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/1a33ccc1a098c0dec7f6e6ceaa3129b68333d844"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:27:30Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:27:30Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"seed: parameterize count, pending members, and email domain\n\nThe seeder hardcoded 8 members at mailinator.com, all with joinedAt set, so\nit could not build the roster Roulette testing needs.\n\n- count (default 8, max 40) and pending (default 0). Pending members get\n  joinedAt: null and uid: null, matching a real unaccepted invite. These are\n  what exercise the reshuffle guard that clears teams for members who never\n  joined, which has never run against real data.\n- emailDomain defaults to example.com, reserved by RFC 2606 and guaranteed\n  never to accept mail. The previous default, mailinator.com, is a real\n  domain that does accept it.\n- Response now returns the created member ids, with pendingMembers listed\n  separately so they can be tracked through a reshuffle.\n\nThere is no status field on Member. Pending membership is joinedAt === null,\nwhich is what teamAssignment and the reshuffle actually read.\n\nStill 12 functions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5504dfa3817e52ecdb7465f3b74539e254bb8d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/c5504dfa3817e52ecdb7465f3b74539e254bb8d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDhlNmRlOTk2NjRiZWIwZTJkNTIxMGFiYjZmMzg4ZDYzY2ViMGVhYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd","sha":"8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd"}],"sha":"8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8e6de99664beb0e2d5210abb6f388d63ceb0eac2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:17:58Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T21:17:58Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"cron: make a dry run exercise the ESPN fetch path\n\nWith no roulette in-season leagues the handler returns at the empty check,\nbefore getCurrentNFLWeek and fetchEspnWeek ever run. So examined:0 proved\nauth, admin init, the Firestore query and module loading, but said nothing\nabout the ESPN path, which is exactly where both of this endpoint''s crash\nbugs lived (import.meta.env absent in Node, and Node''s fetch rejecting a\nrelative URL).\n\nA dry run now probes the schedule deliberately and reports the result as\nscheduleProbe. Out of season there is no current week, so it probes week 1\npurely to exercise the fetch and says so in a note. Scheduled runs are\nunchanged and still return early without the extra calls.\n\nAlso factors the origin derivation into originOf() rather than repeating it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6a1b6e7ffa8ceb67ff6cb7bff860290f93b91a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/a6a1b6e7ffa8ceb67ff6cb7bff860290f93b91a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDhjMmJlNWUyMjNlOTM4YTA2ZTFiZTc1MzQ5NGJiNjY1OTFiMzk4ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/29a7a552ff487e40eb203d193666436d57457a3d","sha":"29a7a552ff487e40eb203d193666436d57457a3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/29a7a552ff487e40eb203d193666436d57457a3d"}],"sha":"8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8c2be5e223e938a06e1be753494bb66591b398fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/29a7a552ff487e40eb203d193666436d57457a3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:59:37Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:59:37Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"reshuffle: widen the cron window from 48 to 60 hours\n\nThe cron fires daily at 02:00 UTC, which is Tuesday 9pm EST / 10pm EDT.\nAgainst a Thursday 8:15pm ET kickoff that run sits at 47.25h in winter,\nclearing a 48h threshold by only 45 minutes. Vercel''s 1 hour flexible cron\nwindow could push it past 48h, skipping Tuesday and deferring the reshuffle\nto Wednesday. Safe, since idempotency and preflight still hold, but it\ncontradicts the \"every Tuesday\" promise in the mode description.\n\n60h gives the Tuesday run 11.75h of margin at its earliest firing while\nleaving the Monday firing, which lands during Monday Night Football, outside\nby 9.25h. Verified across EDT and EST:\n\n  Mon 10pm EDT (MNF live)  70.25h -> skipped\n  Tue  8pm EST (1h early)  48.25h -> IN WINDOW\n  Tue  9pm EST             47.25h -> IN WINDOW\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f80e9b99b064b17e6c45884e6df777d0d131e46d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/f80e9b99b064b17e6c45884e6df777d0d131e46d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/29a7a552ff487e40eb203d193666436d57457a3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/29a7a552ff487e40eb203d193666436d57457a3d","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKD