lank, since the dashboard renders both identically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58a28d05551ca1c8cdc46146a7c1f374e3d6ac46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/58a28d05551ca1c8cdc46146a7c1f374e3d6ac46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/92fce7f07ed9422f565c0a36bdab08162b6624f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/92fce7f07ed9422f565c0a36bdab08162b6624f4","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDkyZmNlN2YwN2VkOTQyMmY1NjVjMGEzNmJkYWIwODE2MmI2NjI0ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9","sha":"262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9"}],"sha":"92fce7f07ed9422f565c0a36bdab08162b6624f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/92fce7f07ed9422f565c0a36bdab08162b6624f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:14:43Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:14:43Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"cron: temporary diagnostic for CRON_SECRET visibility\n\nThe variable is named correctly, typed Secret, scoped All Environments, and a\nredeploy after the last edit still reports it unset, while ADMIN_WIPE_SECRET\nand FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON are read fine by api/admin-inspect.js in the\nsame runtime. Rather than guess again, log which variable names the function\ncan actually see.\n\nNames and lengths only, never values, and to the runtime log rather than the\nHTTP response. To be reverted once this is settled.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58a8540714510108a5f2d5299329cce60e1298b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/58a8540714510108a5f2d5299329cce60e1298b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDI2MmYzODMxMDEzM2NiMTFiMDlkNTU2YjY1NWVkY2YxNjA5MDNhYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59","sha":"83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59"}],"sha":"262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/262f38310133cb11b09d556b655edcf160903ac9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:00:01Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:00:01Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"cron: use explicit .js specifiers across the function''s import graph\n\nRuntime logs showed the real failure, which neither earlier guess had found:\n\n  ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND: Cannot find module ''/var/task/src/lib/reshuffleCore''\n\nVercel does not bundle this function. It transpiles the entrypoint per file\nand leaves relative specifiers untouched, so Node''s ESM loader rejects them\nfor having no extension. Adds explicit .js extensions across every module the\ncron pulls in. Vite resolves .js specifiers back to the .ts sources, so the\nclient build is unaffected, verified by rebuilding and diffing the bundle.\n\nThis is a hypothesis: it only works if Vercel emits compiled .js for src/.\nIf it ships the raw .ts instead, the next error names reshuffleCore.js and the\nfix is to bundle the function ourselves at build time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a10a1a8e1580ad0baedb6f17fa5c0959722b637e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/a10a1a8e1580ad0baedb6f17fa5c0959722b637e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDgzNjEyMTMxOTU3YjU4ZWM4MGE2YzMwNzNjZGRjMDI1ZTUyMTNmNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a","sha":"754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a"}],"sha":"83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/83612131957b58ec80a6c3073cddc025e5213f59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:49:31Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:49:31Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"cron: make the reshuffle endpoint a .ts entrypoint so Vercel can bundle it\n\nThe deployed function returned FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED on every request,\nincluding unauthenticated ones, which means it crashed at module load rather\nthan in the handler. Vercel''s Node builder does not resolve a relative .ts\nimport from a .js entrypoint, so ''../src/lib/reshuffleCore'' was unresolvable.\nA local esbuild bundle resolved it fine, which is why this was missed.\n\nRenaming the entrypoint to .ts is enough: Vercel compiles and bundles a .ts\nfunction together with its imports. Route path and function count are\nunchanged.\n\nAlso adds tsconfig.api.json and folds it into npm run build, so this file is\ntype-checked under strict mode instead of only being bundled. Verified the\npass is not vacuous by planting a deliberate type error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94c306222c0dfc78170872f36d2601f3cf8d10a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/94c306222c0dfc78170872f36d2601f3cf8d10a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDc1NGU3Zjg2MGQ5MGJkOTBmNzY4ZTgxYjcwNjE5Y2I3ZjY3NWM1NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741","sha":"8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741"}],"sha":"754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/754e7f860d90bd90f768e81b70619cb7f675c56a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:35:51Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:35:51Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"roulette phase 4: auto-reshuffle cron\n\nExtracts the reshuffle decisions into a pure src/lib/reshuffleCore.ts with no\nFirestore SDK imports, so the commissioner button (client SDK) and the new\ncron (firebase-admin) share one implementation.\n\n- reshuffleCore: evaluatePreflight, isInReshuffleWindow, planDistribution.\n- reshuffle.ts rewritten on top of it. Button behavior unchanged, including\n  the lazy next-week fetch on the blocked path.\n- api/cron-reshuffle.js: bearer auth that fails closed on an unset\n  CRON_SECRET, one ESPN fetch per run reused across leagues, per league\n  window check then reshuffleHistory idempotency then preflight, ownership\n  lock before any roster write, per league error isolation, ?dryRun=1.\n- vercel.json registers the cron daily at 02:00 UTC, which lands Tuesday\n  evening ET inside the pre-kickoff window.\n\nTwo Node incompatibilities in espn.ts fixed, both of which would have crashed\nthe cron on first call: import.meta.env does not exist outside the Vite\nbundle, and Node fetch cannot parse the relative proxy URL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df173671bda33304e879266da6602f2e4d0bf625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/df173671bda33304e879266da6602f2e4d0bf625"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDg3NDlkNTQ2YTdhMmJlYWIxOTU4ZDMyYjI2YWY0NTY1ZTNhYjE3NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785","sha":"e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785"}],"sha":"8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8749d546a7a2beab1958d32b26af4565e3ab1741"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:26:42Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:26:42Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"api: drop admin-backfill-ownership to free a function slot\n\nThe backfill only ever repaired weeklyResults docs written before ownership\nsnapshots shipped. No such docs exist: the two test leagues it targeted are\ndeleted, and none of the four remaining leagues has ever been in_season, so\nnone has any weeklyResults. Every week written from here on snapshots itself\nat refresh time.\n\nFrees a slot for the Phase 4 cron under Vercel Hobby''s 12-function cap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13e34e00c435ac06a816b46be5400d7bf5780720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/13e34e00c435ac06a816b46be5400d7bf5780720"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGUzZGFjZTI4NzM2ZjNiYjdhZDI1MjNhY2U2MGMyMmVmNTViYzA3ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308","sha":"3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308"}],"sha":"e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/e3dace28736f3bb7ad2523ace60c22ef55bc0785"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:08:39Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:08:39Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"roulette phase 3: commissioner-triggered manual reshuffle\n\nClient-side only, no new serverless function (Vercel Hobby is at 12/12).\n\n- New src/lib/reshuffle.ts: preflightReshuffle() verifies every game of the\n  current week is final and the next week has not kicked off, both via the\n  existing /api/espn-scores proxy. executeReshuffle() locks the current\n  week''s ownership snapshot first, aborting if it does not come back locked,\n  then redeals with the existing crypto Fisher-Yates shuffle and writes the\n  new rosters plus the history entry in one batch.\n- League gains reshuffleHistory?: ReshuffleRecord[], defaulted in\n  normalizeLeague(). No subcollection: the per-week ownership snapshot on\n  weeklyResults is already the roster history.\n- Teams tab shows a Reshuffle Teams button for roulette + in_season +\n  commissioner, with a confirm modal that reports the blocking reason and\n  disables confirm when preflight fails.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"943e10d55abb4d2f74bdc67d45e60149b6b2bde7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/943e10d55abb4d2f74bdc67d45e60149b6b2bde7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDNjYTMxYWEyNzMzMTYwZWE0ZTg0ZjFjYTM1N2I5ZjU4NmVmMTMzMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9","sha":"4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9"}],"sha":"3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/3ca31aa2733160ea4e84f1ca357b9f586ef13308"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:40:12Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:40:12Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"roulette phase 2: per-week ownership snapshots\n\nWinner detection now reads a frozen per-week ownership map instead of the\nlive members list, so a roster change (or a future Roulette reshuffle) can\nnever rewrite who won a past week.\n\n- WeeklyResult gains ownership + ownershipLockedAt, with a\n  normalizeWeeklyResult() defaulting both for legacy docs.\n- refreshWeek snapshots ownership on every refresh until the first game of\n  the week goes final, then locks it.\n- computeWinningMembersFromOwnership() replaces computeWinningMembers() in\n  the writer; the live-ownership version stays for other callers.\n- Game cards resolve team owners from the week''s snapshot, falling back to\n  live ownership when a doc has none.\n- New api/admin-backfill-ownership.js stamps snapshots onto existing docs.\n- admin-inspect-members and admin-list-weekly-results merged into\n  api/admin-inspect.js?action= to stay at Vercel Hobby''s 12-function cap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94d07aea5cf265f6cfdbeeb8832172eee6c29480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/94d07aea5cf265f6cfdbeeb8832172eee6c29480"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDQ4ODdmOWU0ZmM0ZTllOTBiOTY4ZDQ3Mjk4YWIwMDU0M2FlNTZlZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/ca71c54a8be85e897a689097d2e32b0e5dbe9e5c","sha":"ca71c54a8be85e897a689097d2e32b0e5dbe9e5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ca71c54a8be85e897a689097d2e32b0e5dbe9e5c"}],"sha":"4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/4887f9e4fc4e9e90b968d47298ab00543ae56ed9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ca71c54a8be85e897a689097d2e32b0e5dbe9e5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:04:38Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:04:38Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"roulette: add league mode field, creation selector, commissioner toggle, pill\n\nPhase 1 of Roulette Mode: data model and mode selector only. Nothing acts\non the field yet; reshuffle logic ships in a later phase.\n\n- League gains mode: ''classic'' | ''roulette'', defaulted in normalizeLeague()\n  so existing docs read as classic.\n- CreateLeague shows two radio cards after the league name, default Classic.\n- Teams tab gets a commissioner-only League Mode section, editable during\n  recruiting and assigned, frozen at in_season and complete.\n- Roulette leagues show a small pill next to the league name / season line\n  for every member.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1bdda5f1c8bfef0f3dd653cfb6adfeee5a36e39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/a1bdda5f1c8bfef0f3dd653cfb6adfeee5a36e39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/ca71c54a8be85e897a689097d2e32b0e5dbe9e5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazin