tps://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/f316a6343ec66b469fef57ee2cecd5321cc8a83b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:59:20Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:59:20Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"ads: add Meta domain-verification meta tag\n\nVerifies 19pool.com in Business Settings > Brand Safety > Domains, which\nis required before conversion events can be configured for the domain.\n\nThe Pixel ID itself is supplied via VITE_META_PIXEL_ID (set in Vercel\nproduction), not by pasting Meta''s raw snippet here. The snippet\ninitializes unconditionally; routing through src/lib/metaPixel.ts keeps\nthe Global Privacy Control check and the stored opt-out that /privacy\ncommits to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fefb7fac165e78f23071c6411abb835c3155eaa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/fefb7fac165e78f23071c6411abb835c3155eaa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/f316a6343ec66b469fef57ee2cecd5321cc8a83b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.git