events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/037a04fa17a0ad490221db50b4fc96ef0bcd5898/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:37:06Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T17:37:06Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"ads: paid-acquisition landing page, Meta pixel (inert), attribution\n\nGroundwork for running Facebook/Instagram ads.\n\nNew /nfl-pool-app landing page as the ad destination. Meta''s Gambling\nand Games policy restricts advertising paid-entry contests with cash\nprizes, and reviewers read the destination page — so this page sells the\nsoftware (team assignment, live scores, standings) and carries no entry\nfees, pots, payouts, or dollar figures. The main \"/\" page is unchanged.\nUses points-only variants of the marketing screenshots; the footer hides\nits Venmo donate link on this route.\n\nMeta Pixel is wired but inert: with no VITE_META_PIXEL_ID set, no script\nis injected and nothing is sent. It also honors Global Privacy Control\nand a stored opt-out. Conversion events at signup and league creation.\n\nFirst-party UTM/click-ID capture is independent of the pixel and sends\nnothing to third parties. It is written after account creation as a\nbest-effort update so it can never fail a signup.\n\nPrivacy policy updated to disclose Meta as a recipient, replacing the\n\"no advertising / no analytics SDK\" claims, and documents how to opt out.\n\nExtracted shared marketing primitives so the two pages share styling but\nno copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4500787434ee25ff8403d6489c934bb88a3e03d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/4500787434ee25ff8403d6489c934bb88a3e03d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/037a04fa17a0ad490221db50b4fc96ef0bcd5898","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/037a04fa17a0ad490221db50b4fc96ef0bcd5898","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDAzN2EwNGZhMTdhMGFkNDkwMjIxZGI1MGI0ZmM5NmVmMGJjZDU4OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/9eb8b61d1af09b21cbe6ea3c03122b40148b1c25","sha":"9eb8b61d1af09b21cbe6ea3c03122b40148b1c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/9eb8b61d1af09b21cbe6ea3c03122b40148b1c25"}],"sha":"037a04fa17a0ad490221db50b4fc96ef0bcd5898","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/037a04fa17a0ad490221db50b4fc96ef0bcd5898"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"http