2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/727d1b8950153a101c998378894cfe5d7e1ba599/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:37:56Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:37:56Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"players: name from firstName+lastName, team pills next to each row\n\nRow name now composes firstName + lastName from the member doc\ndirectly instead of reading the denormalized member.name. If both\nfields are empty the row shows \"Player\" — never the email prefix,\nwhich was leaking identity to other members.\n\nAdds a right-side slot listing the player''s assigned NFL teams as\ncompact mono-abbrev pills (title attribute carries the full team\nname for hover). Empty during recruiting, populates as soon as the\ncommissioner assigns teams.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c303acdf2d16ed19d8fdafd8f4923feb0da2946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/5c303acdf2d16ed19d8fdafd8f4923feb0da2946"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/727d1b8950153a101c998378894cfe5d7e1ba599","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}",