/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ac3745f8f84b263aa7d26eb25887a55893beecd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:33:51Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:33:51Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"dashboard: add Players tab — read-only roster for all members\n\nNon-commissioners had no way to see who else was in the league —\nAdmin > Members is gated to the commissioner. New main-nav Players\ntab shows a clean roster (avatar + name + commissioner badge) with a\ncapacity bar, sorted commissioner-first then by join order. Pending\ninvites appear under an \"Invited, not joined yet\" subhead so members\ncan see who''s still expected without exposing invite email addresses.\n\nVisible to everyone (including commissioners) — the commissioner\nstill uses Admin > Members for edits; this is their at-a-glance view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66034d39bf88e7586c8755a4b3b5c3c9a15d3439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/66034d39bf88e7586c8755a4b3b5c3c9a15d3439"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/ac3745f8f84b263aa7d26eb25887a55893beecd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-ama