amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/785ffc90df28ea681785ecb44804a2dbb21c9165/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:25:54Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:25:54Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"admin/league: move League last, rename card, add inline name edit\n\nSub-nav order is now Members / Teams / Payments / League — League\nfalls to the end since it''s the least-frequent commissioner action.\nDefault admin sub-tab flips to Members to match.\n\nOn the League tab: Entry Fee card moves above the League Name card\n(rename of what was \"League\"), drops the \"Your league at a glance\"\nsubtitle, and gains an inline Edit for the league name that mirrors\nthe Entry Fee edit affordance. Also restructures the sub-card so the\ninput takes the full row width when editing — previously the status\npill squeezed the input to nothing on mobile.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55e511a5f40284866f6d3c12e3278617fb57d046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/55e511a5f40284866f6d3c12e3278617fb57d046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/785ffc90df28ea681785ecb44804a2dbb21c9165","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co