ing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/5529e89a9155a8f7833eff36f0e177a05a3b42c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:53:33Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:53:33Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"dashboard: add League admin sub-tab, replace Account link with person icon\n\nCommissioner-only view of league identity + entry fee + Delete League\nnow lives at Admin > League as the default sub-tab. Same content that\nused to sit on the Account page — commissioners get it in one place\nunder Admin so their Account page can shrink to just profile / security.\n\nMasthead: replaces the \"Account\" text link with a flat outlined user\nicon (Heroicons outline \"user\"). Removes the Sign Out button from the\ntop bar — it moves to the bottom of the Account page instead, so\nevery dashboard view stays visually quiet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2240d1c5a5428242642267811140ee1ebcd7cf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/f2240d1c5a5428242642267811140ee1ebcd7cf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/5529e89a9155a8f7833eff36f0e177a05a3b42c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co