":"2026-08-17T18:18:33Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"dashboard: fold Members/Teams/Payments under Admin, add Invite Members CTA\n\nMain nav was wrapping to two lines on smaller viewports. Consolidates\ncommissioner tools under a single Admin tab with a lighter uppercase\nsub-nav for Members / Teams / Payments — main row stays on one line.\n\nAlso adds an \"Invite Members\" button on the preseason overview so a\nbrand-new commissioner has an obvious next step instead of hunting\nthrough the tab bar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aaa648b589315c6cbfd6bad70941226ddb629fb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/aaa648b589315c6cbfd6bad70941226ddb629fb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/e8dea88a1d4c075726e60d73e9585db0983441ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"h