eaving it blank is fine for pools that aren''t chasing money.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9477310d97b3d23046bdd43f4ff050899d3f7ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/b9477310d97b3d23046bdd43f4ff050899d3f7ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/31d4b139d584e8ba56732779a869e84364d8c66f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/31d4b139d584e8ba56732779a869e84364d8c66f","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDMxZDRiMTM5ZDU4NGU4YmE1NjczMjc3OWE4NjllODQzNjRkOGM2NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb","sha":"8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb"}],"sha":"31d4b139d584e8ba56732779a869e84364d8c66f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/31d4b139d584e8ba56732779a869e84364d8c66f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:30:53Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:30:53Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"landing: fix top-clipped phone, mobile reorder, logo → 19POOL, drop hero secondary CTA\n\nFour asks:\n\n  1. Removed the \"Join with a code\" secondary CTA from Hero. The\n     primary \"Create your league →\" stays; the \"Got an invite?\" text\n     link below still provides the invited-player path. (There''s a\n     second \"Join with a code\" in FinalCTA at the bottom of the page\n     — left alone; user selected the Hero one specifically.)\n\n  2. Logo is now \"19POOL\" (all caps, no gap between \"19\" and \"POOL\")\n     everywhere the wordmark appears:\n       • Landing Nav\n       • Landing Footer\n       • Dashboard header\n     Kept the two-color treatment (volt \"19\" + ink \"POOL\"). Bumped\n     the \"POOL\" span to match the \"19\" font size (was smaller in some\n     places for the previous mixed-case treatment).\n\n  3. Phone image top was getting clipped along with the bottom because\n     the section had md:overflow-hidden. Switched clipping strategy:\n       • Removed md:overflow-hidden from the section (top overhang\n         renders freely now).\n       • Added clip-path: inset(0 0 50px 0) directly on the image\n         via [clip-path:inset(0_0_50px_0)]. Bottom 50px is masked;\n         top and sides are unaffected.\n     Verified in-browser: top overhangs section top rule by 49px\n     (target 50, off by 1 hairline border), cut edge lands within\n     1px of the bottom rule.\n\n  4. Mobile reorder + spacing:\n       • Phone image moved BETWEEN the headline and body paragraphs\n         on mobile (was: text → phone at end). New DOM order for\n         mobile: h2 → mobile-only <img> → paragraph block.\n       • Tighter mobile spacing: mt-4 (16px) around the phone image\n         instead of the previous 40px gap. max-width shrunk to 260\n         so the phone doesn''t dominate a phone screen.\n       • Desktop unchanged — mobile-only image is hidden on md+, the\n         absolute phone image on the right takes over.\n     Removed the previous parent''s space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 in favor of\n     explicit margin on the body block (mt-4 md:mt-8) so the mobile\n     phone insertion doesn''t inherit the wide space-y rhythm.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2be4e1020f63d2efc657f3b73cd8094b9637921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/f2be4e1020f63d2efc657f3b73cd8094b9637921"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDg1MzBlOWRhMWI3YTYyMmRkNjQ1YWJlOTczNDlhZDIzMzE4M2FlYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/e4e65b164fe28736f90be29dbdb42d0374c73461","sha":"e4e65b164fe28736f90be29dbdb42d0374c73461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/e4e65b164fe28736f90be29dbdb42d0374c73461"}],"sha":"8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/8530e9da1b7a622dd645abe97349ad233183aebb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/e4e65b164fe28736f90be29dbdb42d0374c73461/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:15:39Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:15:39Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"landing: NeverStarts phone extends past both section rules, bottom clipped\n\nCustom section markup replaces <Section tint> so we can:\n  • md:overflow-hidden on the section (clips image at bottom rule)\n  • md:min-h-[570px] on the wrapper to force enough height that the\n    image genuinely extends 50px past the bottom rule\n  • position: absolute on the image (md+) so its layout doesn''t drive\n    the section''s height — text drives it, image floats over the\n    right column via an empty grid placeholder\n\nResult: phone image visually overhangs the section''s top rule by 50px\n(preserved from the previous change) AND its bottom 50px are clipped\nby the section''s bottom rule, so the phone looks intentionally sliced\nby the rule as it exits.\n\nVerified in-browser at 1248 desktop viewport:\n  imgTopAboveSectionTopBy: 49px    (target 50, off by 1 hairline border)\n  imgBottomPastSectionBottomBy: 49px\n\nMobile treatment (< md): phone stacks under text in normal flow with\nno clipping, no absolute positioning.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0afcf8d1fa7345bad929ac8b63759db750b30d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/a0afcf8d1fa7345bad929ac8b63759db750b30d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/e4e65b164fe28736f90be29dbdb42d0374c73461","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/e4e65b164fe28736f90be29dbdb42d0374c73461","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGU0ZTY1YjE2NGZlMjg3MzZmOTBiZTI5ZGJkYjQyZDAzNzRjNzM0NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/845a6dc19ae3286f11a538223847cad5ae90686c","sha":"845a6dc19ae3286f11a538223847cad5ae90686c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/845a6dc19ae3286f11a538223847cad5ae90686c"}],"sha":"e4e65b164fe28736f90be29dbdb42d0374c73461","url":"htt