:"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/352c1d6d86a83efd59dd33d98e91c3e434c88085/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:08:54Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:08:54Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"chore: redeploy to pick up VITE_TEST_* env vars","tree":{"sha":"5a2eac812a5de017c620d89ade73578d3e238264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/5a2eac812a5de017c620d89ade73578d3e238264"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/352c1d6d86a83efd59dd33d98e91c3e434c88085","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/352c1d6d86a83efd59dd33d98e91c3e434c88085","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDM1MmMxZDZkODZhODNlZmQ1OWRkMzNkOThlOTFjM2U0MzRjODgwODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c","sha":"2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c"}],"sha":"352c1d6d86a83efd59dd33d98e91c3e434c88085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/352c1d6d86a83efd59dd33d98e91c3e434c88085"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:59:05Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:59:05Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: test-mode ESPN season override\n\nTwo client-side env vars let us dry-run the mid-season UI against real\nhistorical NFL data before 2026 games exist:\n\n  VITE_TEST_SEASON       — year to fetch (e.g. \"2025\"). null = normal.\n  VITE_TEST_CURRENT_WEEK — pinned week 1-18. null = calculated from date.\n\nBoth unset in production; both set in the Vercel preview/dev where\nwe''re testing.\n\nHelpers (src/lib/espn.ts)\n  • getTestSeason()        parses VITE_TEST_SEASON (positive int > 2000)\n  • getTestCurrentWeek()   parses VITE_TEST_CURRENT_WEEK (1..18)\n  • isTestMode()           = getTestSeason() !== null\n  • getEffectiveSeason(y)  returns test season if set, else y — wrap this\n                            around any league.season passed to fetchEspnWeek.\n\nWiring\n  • getCurrentNFLWeek short-circuits to the pinned week when both\n    overrides are set. Ignores the caller''s season in that case — the\n    test week is a fixed simulation, not per-league math. OverviewTab\n    already calls getCurrentNFLWeek, so it picks up the override for\n    free.\n  • scoringWriter.refreshWeek fetches with getEffectiveSeason(league.\n    season). The resulting WeeklyResult doc''s `season` field also\n    stores the fetched year so a doc''s declared season matches its\n    contents — otherwise you''d get a doc saying season: 2026 with\n    2025 games in it. When you flip test mode off, no more test-year\n    docs get written, and old ones self-identify as historical by\n    their year field.\n  • fetchEspnWeek unchanged — still takes any year. Keeps the fetch\n    layer honest.\n  • api/espn-scores proxy unchanged — pure passthrough.\n\nUI\n  • TestModeBanner in App.tsx: sticky top-of-viewport strip with a 🧪\n    icon and \"showing 2025 season, week 4\" text. Amber bg/border/\n    text (bg-amber-500/20 border-b border-amber-500/40 text-amber-200)\n    at text-xs. Renders on every route (dashboard, landing, join,\n    account) when isTestMode(). Returns null entirely in production —\n    no hidden DOM.\n  • sticky top-0 z-[70] so it stays visible on scroll. z-[70] beats\n    the existing toast (z-[60]) and modal (z-40) so it always shows.\n\nDocs\n  • .env.example added with both vars empty and inline docs. No values\n    committed to git; production Vercel keeps both blank.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a2eac812a5de017c620d89ade73578d3e238264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/5a2eac812a5de017c620d89ade73578d3e238264"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDJlZTlkODMxM2ZkODYyMGFiZmRmODllNjliYjBjYzdmZmQ2ZWI4MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529","sha":"d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529"}],"sha":"2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/2ee9d8313fd8620abfdf89e69bb0cc7ffd6eb80c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:58:04Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:58:04Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: commissioner can edit a member''s name or email\n\nNew pencil (✎) button on every non-commissioner member row. Opens a\nmodal to fix typos in firstName, lastName, or email — the kind of\ncorrection that used to require Firebase Console access.\n\nBehavior\n  • Non-empty name (first OR last) and valid email are required.\n  • Duplicate-email guard: findMemberByEmail runs whenever the email\n    changed. If another member in this league already uses that\n    address, the modal shows an error and doesn''t write.\n  • Save writes to the member doc''s firstName, lastName, name\n    (recomputed via buildDisplayName), and email.\n  • If the edited row is somehow the commissioner (defensive — the UI\n    hides the pencil for commissioner rows), league.commissionerName\n    is also updated so headers/standings stay in sync.\n\nExplicit scope notes in the modal, tailored by member state\n  • Joined member: \"This is what''s shown in the members list and\n    standings. It doesn''t change how the player signs in — that''s set\n    in their own account.\" (Auth email is separate; editing here is\n    display-only.)\n  • Pending invite: \"Their existing invite link stays valid — the\n    token is tied to the invite, not the email.\" (No token rotation\n    needed; the URL keeps working.)\n\nRow layout\n  • Pencil sits between the resend/status area and the × remove\n    button. Amber hover-tint to distinguish from × red.\n  • Hidden on the commissioner''s own row (they use Account for their\n    own profile) and always visible on other rows regardless of\n    league status — matches the recent \"commissioner has edit\n    authority through the whole lifecycle\" decision.\n\nNo rules changes — commissioner branch of the members update rule\nalready allows writing any field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1470a18395fcc6201fc6dd32c79291b6dc3dcd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/b1470a18395fcc6201fc6dd32c79291b6dc3dcd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGQ4NDIxZmU4ZGJmZGNiOTVkMzdmZDAxZDc3NzM0NTg3ZmZmNDE1Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1","sha":"7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1"}],"sha":"d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/d8421fe8dbfdcb95d37fd01d77734587fff41529"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:49:24Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:49:24Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: tap-to-move for team assignments (mobile-friendly)\n\nHTML5 drag-and-drop doesn''t fire on touch devices — mobile commissioners\ncouldn''t reassign teams at all. Adding a parallel tap-to-move flow that\nworks on every input method without a new dependency.\n\n  • Tap a team chip → chip enters a \"selected\" state (amber ring).\n  • Tap a member card (or the Unowned card) → team moves there.\n  • Tap the same chip again → deselects. Or hit Cancel in the pill.\n\nA small sticky pill appears at the top of the tab while a selection is\nactive: \"Move BUF — tap a member card [Cancel]\". Sticky so a scrolling\nfinger can still find the cancel affordance.\n\nCards visually preview as tap targets (amber outline, pointer cursor)\nwhen a selection is active and this card isn''t the source — same look\nas the existing dragover highlight, reused for touch parity.\n\nImplementation notes:\n  • handleDrop''s write logic extracted into commitMove(team, from, to).\n    Both flows call it, so the Firestore write path (batched updates\n    to members + league.unownedTeams) is unchanged and untested-code-\n    free.\n  • Chip clicks stopPropagation so tapping a chip inside a card doesn''t\n    also trigger the card''s \"move here\" onClick.\n  • No changes to draggable / onDragStart / onDrop — desktop mouse\n    drag continues to work exactly as before. Tap flow is additive.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bbdbe2e0896bb2edf416c81382e9df20f06528f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/6bbdbe2e0896bb2edf416c81382e9df20f06528f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDdlNDJlMmFmZTIxM2I4NDYxMjY0YzRkNDY0OTQzNzljMjk2NDg0YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b","sha":"fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b"}],"sha":"7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/7e42e2afe213b8461264c4d46494379c296484c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:38:56Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:38:56Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: commissioner can edit teams and roster during in_season and complete\n\nReverses the earlier decision to freeze the roster after Week 1\nkickoff. Commissioners can now fix rosters and team assignments at\nany point in the season lifecycle. Historical weeklyResults docs are\nnever touched — they stay as the audit trail for what actually\nhappened week by week.\n\nFirestore rules\n  • Member delete: commissioner branch drops the != ''in_season''\n    guard. Now allowed at all statuses. Self-removal (a member\n    leaving via /account) still stays limited to ''recruiting'' so\n    nobody can abandon a paid slot unilaterally.\n\nremoveMember helper (src/lib/members.ts)\n  • Drops the in_season/complete guard. The ''assigned'' branch that\n    also resets skipReassignmentCheck is untouched. The ''locked''\n    reason stays in the RemoveMemberResult union for API stability\n    even though no producer emits it now.\n  • Docstring updated to reflect the new behavior.\n\nMembersTab\n  • canRemove is now unconditionally true. The × button appears on\n    every non-commissioner row at every status.\n  • New amber banner above the member list during in_season and\n    complete, with distinct copy for each state.\n  • Confirmation modal picks up an italic contextual note when\n    removing a joined member during in_season (\"moves teams to the\n    unowned pool\") or complete (\"doesn''t change historical results\").\n\nTeamsTab\n  • The in_season branch was read-only. Rewritten to be fully editable\n    (same drag-drop handlers as the ''assigned'' branch), with the\n    Reroll and Lock buttons omitted. The reassignment-mismatch banner\n    stays gated to ''assigned'' — it''s noise post-lock.\n  • Prominent amber warning banner above the panels, with copy that\n    differs for in_season (winner detection may shift for future\n    weeks) vs complete (historical results are frozen).\n  • Compact header replaces the old 🔒 \"League locked\" chip — now\n    reads \"Season in progress\" (🏈) or \"Season complete\" (🏁), with\n    the lockedAt date and member counts inline.\n\nleaveLeague was already recruiting-only — no change needed there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"926ebeaf3d90eba91df9f0448df84eb35f563c32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/926ebeaf3d90eba91df9f0448df84eb35f563c32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGZhMzhiMTU3ODU5Yjg4OTU2OWI0NWI4OGY5ODQ1NGM3OTdhMjA3M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/9aa19b2369cb15798fcafa5c10f57a89ea169d6d","sha":"9aa19b2369cb15798fcafa5c10f57a89ea169d6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/9aa19b2369cb15798fcafa5c10f57a89ea169d6d"}],"sha":"fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/fa38b157859b889569b45b88f98454c797a2073b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/9aa19b2369cb15798fcafa5c10f57a89ea169d6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:21:07Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:21:07Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"copy: neutral wording on the Account Venmo-handle helper\n\n\"So your commissioner can send you a Venmo request for the entry fee\"\naddresses a player; commissioners read the same helper on their own\nAccount page. Rewrite it as a description of what the field is for so\nthe sentence works for anyone: \"Used for entry-fee Venmo requests in\nyour league.\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ce53ec61ea900b2b7469f0a35d5364912857d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/7ce53ec61ea900b2b7469f0a35d5364912857d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/9aa19b2369cb15798fcafa5c10f57a89ea169d6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":