":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/743e7670b79e2f98ed9e0abc1ffc254236d7de4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:17:26Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:17:26Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"ux: Payments row without Venmo gets a Find-on-Venmo link\n\nPreviously showed inert \"No Venmo on file\" text. Replace with a live\nlink to venmo.com so the commissioner has one click to open Venmo''s\nsearch and look the player up. Tooltip explains the situation (\"No\nVenmo handle on file — search for them on Venmo.\") for anyone\nhovering. Same subtle styling as the request link, opens in a new\ntab, still hidden entirely on the commissioner''s own row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6dc9eb8298ab780eed63609043b0bfa6f7f93722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/6dc9eb8298ab780eed63609043b0bfa6f7f93722"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/743e7670b79e2f98ed9e0abc1ffc254236d7de4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/743e7670b79e2f98ed9e0abc1ffc254236d7de4c","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDc0M2U3NjcwYjc5ZTJmOThlZDllMGFiYzFmZmMyNTQyMzZkN2RlNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b","sha":"ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b"}],"sha":"743e7670b79e2f98ed9e0abc1ffc254236d7de4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/743e7670b79e2f98ed9e0abc1ffc254236d7de4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:13:41Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:13:41Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: player-owned Venmo handle for accurate Payments requests\n\nThe previous Payments-tab Venmo button pointed at league.venmo (the\ncommissioner''s own handle) — a charge URL targets the recipient, so\nthat would have opened a request for the commissioner to charge\nthemselves. Wrong direction.\n\nFix: each player owns their own Venmo handle. Commissioner reads the\nplayer''s handle to build a charge URL that requests money FROM the\nplayer, TO the commissioner.\n\nData\n  • Member.venmo?: string added. Optional so legacy docs/members who\n    haven''t set it read as no-Venmo without a migration. Denormalized\n    from users/{uid}.venmo when the player edits their profile.\n\nAccount → Profile\n  • New \"Venmo Handle (optional)\" input under email. Save writes to\n    both the user doc (source of truth) and the current member doc\n    (denormalized copy) — same pattern as firstName/lastName. Leading\n    @ is stripped on save; the handle is stored bare.\n\nPayments tab\n  • Button text now shows the recipient: \"Send Venmo Request to\n    @sarah-chen →\" with the handle highlighted in amber.\n  • When a player hasn''t set a Venmo handle: subtle grey \"No Venmo on\n    file\" text (with tooltip pointing to Account) instead of hiding\n    silently — the commissioner sees why they can''t send a request.\n  • Commissioner''s own row: no self-request. Neither the button nor\n    the \"No Venmo on file\" text renders — self-charge is nonsense.\n\nleague.venmo (set at league creation) is left alone; it''s now\neffectively unused by Payments, but stays for backwards compatibility\nand any future \"commissioner''s own handle\" surface.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67b06b62cdab0df47b554bb23fe3895f75c46e2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/67b06b62cdab0df47b554bb23fe3895f75c46e2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGZmNTA0NmMzNzRmMzVjNWU4YmZkNWUzYmZlMWZiNDU3MjcxMDg4M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3","sha":"bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3"}],"sha":"ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ff5046c374f35c5e8bfd5e3bfe1fb4572710883b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:15:04Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:15:04Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: Payments tab (commissioner-only) with paid/unpaid tracker\n\nFourth dashboard tab for tracking who''s paid their entry. Commissioner-\nonly, same visibility gate as Teams. Layered behind a feature-flag\nhelper so the eventual Commissioner Pro paywall is a one-line change,\nnot a codebase sweep.\n\nData\n  • Member type gets `paid?: boolean` and `paidAt?: Timestamp | null`.\n    Optional so legacy docs (pre-tracker) read cleanly as unpaid — no\n    normalize step needed at the read path, no data migration.\n\nFeature flag\n  • New src/lib/features.ts with hasPaymentTracker(league) — currently\n    always true. Every gate (tab visibility, PaymentsTab render branch\n    in Dashboard) reads through it; the boolean is never inlined.\n\nUI\n  • src/pages/dashboard/PaymentsTab.tsx. Header shows collected/owed\n    totals + paid count. Native <select> filter for All/Paid/Unpaid\n    with live counts in the options. Per-member row: avatar, name,\n    email, per-player amount, status pill (amber unpaid / green paid),\n    and either Mark Paid + Venmo request (unpaid) or \"Paid on X\" +\n    Mark Unpaid (paid).\n  • Venmo deep-link uses the documented request URL format\n    https://venmo.com/{handle}?txn=charge&amount=X&note=Y — opens in\n    a new tab, hidden entirely when league.venmo is unset (spec\n    allowed either that or a disabled state; hiding reads cleaner).\n  • Amount owed = league.seasonEntry (per-player value), never\n    getSeasonPot()/count, so a manual pot override doesn''t mislead\n    what each player actually owes.\n\nFirestore\n  • No rule changes needed — the commissioner branch of the members\n    update rule already allows updating any field (paid/paidAt land\n    in the same permission surface as the rest).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7f97b3e8e8b926ecfa0034af362903a7a58748b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/f7f97b3e8e8b926ecfa0034af362903a7a58748b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGJjZTVlMjBmYTM5N2IyMWFkNjgxODU2YTg5MWFjNzM1NzQ5NGFlYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af","sha":"943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af"}],"sha":"bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/bce5e20fa397b21ad681856a891ac7357494aeb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:52:15Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:52:15Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"copy: player-facing wording on the Money card\n\nOverview is read by everyone, but the entry helper and weekly-share\nlabel were written from the commissioner''s angle.\n\n  • \"Each player Venmos you this\" → \"Everyone pays the same to enter\"\n    Works whether the reader is a player, the commissioner, or someone\n    reading before or after payment.\n\n  • \"Weekly share:\" → \"Weekly pot:\"\n    Parallel to \"Season Pot\" above and easier to grok than the jargon.\n    The \"(over 18 weeks)\" tail stays for context.\n\nSame tweak applied to the Account MoneyEditCard so both surfaces speak\nthe same language.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f89e8b9320abf30484dc17c0059ee3105bfcbe54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/f89e8b9320abf30484dc17c0059ee3105bfcbe54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDk0M2NkMjgzNTYwYTc0YTJmOGU5OWFjN2VjY2JkYmZmYjRlZWUzYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55","sha":"2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55"}],"sha":"943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/943cd283560a74a2f8e99ac7eccbdbffb4eee3af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:37:18Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:37:18Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: move money editing to Account, keep Overview read-only\n\nCommissioners were seeing edit affordances on the Overview tab that\nplayers didn''t — visual noise, and the wrong mental model. The\nOverview is now identical for everyone: entry, pot, and weekly share\nas read-only numbers. Editing lives on the Account page under a new\n\"Money\" card, commissioner-only.\n\n  • OverviewTab MoneyCard: stripped to display-only. No state, no\n    handlers, no modals, no props for leagueCode/isCommissioner.\n    Removes the ChoiceRow subcomponent that was only used by the\n    edit modal. Show gate now just getSeasonPot > 0 (previously also\n    admitted commissioner-with-empty pot so they could set it up\n    from Overview — commissioners now go to Account for that).\n\n  • Account: new MoneyEditCard between the League and Danger Zone\n    cards, wrapped in the standard <Card> chrome. Renders only when\n    the user is the commissioner of a league. Reuses the shared\n    Modal/ModalCancel components. Delegates toast display to the\n    Account page''s existing showToast (passed as onToast prop) so\n    there''s a single toast surface on the page.\n\n  • Both the pot-choice \"what about per-player?\" flow and the\n    reset-to-auto flow moved intact from OverviewTab to Account.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d70a91d4b89b6e6b451d329fbb07b3be76156d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/d70a91d4b89b6e6b451d329fbb07b3be76156d1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKDJhMmJhY2FmNDYwOWY2YTY1YzA0YzEyOGJhMGJkOTE1NjA3NDFkNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c","sha":"cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c"}],"sha":"2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/2a2bacaf4609f6a65c04c128ba0bd91560741d55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:25:12Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:25:12Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"fix: weekly-share math now nearest-cent, not floor-to-dollar\n\ncomputeWeeklyShareFromPot used Math.floor((pot/weeks)) — a leftover\nfrom the original whole-dollar-only scoring math. Effect: $1,600 / 18\ngave $88 per week, but $88 × 18 = $1,584 stranded $16 that would never\nactually be paid out.\n\nSwitch to nearest-cent: Math.round((pot/weeks)*100)/100. Worst-case\nrounding artifact across normal pot sizes is under 10¢ (e.g. $1,600\ngives $88.89 × 18 = $1,600.02). Real leagues Venmo in cents anyway.\n\nDownstream scoringWriter already uses the same helper and rounds\npayoutPerWinner to cents, so the change flows through cleanly.\nfmtDollars already shows cents when the value has them, so displays on\nthe CreateLeague preview line and the Money card render correctly with\nno formatter changes ($88.89, $27.78, $100 when it divides evenly).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94e8066db27ce927b604f518e115478ff4a95099","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/94e8066db27ce927b604f518e115478ff4a95099"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGNmMjNiNGMwMjY4YTgxZjUyZjk4MDAyYjBkNDg1N2E2NDkwMTE3M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2","sha":"b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2"}],"sha":"cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/cf23b4c0268a81f52f98002b0d4857a64901173c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:17:55Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:17:55Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"copy: show weekly-share math on the Create League preview line\n\nThe season-pot number matters less than the per-week payout for someone\ndeciding on an entry fee. Extend the live math line with the weekly\nshare and mention the 18-week NFL regular season explicitly. Uses\ncomputeWeeklyShareFromPot so the math matches what the Money card on\nthe dashboard will show after creation.\n\nExample rendered line for a $50 entry:\n  \"If you have 32 players, your season pot will be $1,600 — that''s $88\n  per week over the 18-week NFL regular season.\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"761fe1b58c2670b3e273934ea8cad6d0a020ca3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/761fe1b58c2670b3e273934ea8cad6d0a020ca3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGI4Y2EzM2QwYWQ4YWUyYWM3Y2YyNmZmMmE5M2ZiNmE5MGMyODlkZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482","sha":"ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482"}],"sha":"b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/b8ca33d0ad8ae2ac7cf26ff2a93fb6a90c289df2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:13:18Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T22:13:18Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"feat: editable per-player entry + season pot with auto/manual modes\n\nTwo related admin fields commissioners can adjust from the Overview\ndashboard. They start linked (pot = entry × memberCount) but can diverge.\n\nData model\n  • League.potOverride: number | null. null = auto, number = manual.\n  • normalizeLeague seeds legacy docs to null (auto).\n\nHelpers (src/lib/scoring.ts)\n  • getSeasonPot(league) — returns override when set, auto otherwise.\n  • isPotManuallySet(league) — override != null.\n  • computeWeeklyShareFromPot(pot, weeks=18) — new primary path.\n  scoringWriter switches to computeWeeklyShareFromPot(getSeasonPot(league))\n  so manual pots flow into per-week payouts.\n\nCreateLeague\n  • Label: \"Per-Player Entry Fee ($)\" (was \"Season Entry Amount\").\n  • Helper copy explains it''s what each player Venmos.\n  • Live math: \"If you have 32 players, your season pot will be $X.\"\n  • League doc now writes potOverride: null.\n\nOverviewTab MoneyCard replaces PotSummaryCard\n  • Shown at all statuses (previously only in-season).\n  • Two-column layout: Per-Player Entry + Season Pot, weekly share as a\n    footer line.\n  • Commissioner: inline number-input edit for each field.\n  • Editing entry: writes seasonEntry; if pot was manual, drops the\n    override (spec: \"re-syncs the pot to auto behavior\").\n  • Editing pot: if new value equals autoPot, silently returns to auto.\n    Otherwise opens the \"what about per-player?\" modal with two radios —\n    keep entry (writes potOverride), or sync entry so math matches\n    (writes new seasonEntry, clears potOverride).\n  • Manually-set pot shows a Reset-to-auto link + confirmation modal.\n  • Non-commissioners: no Edit / Reset affordances, just the numbers.\n  • All modals use the top-anchored overlay pattern (items-start,\n    pt-16 sm:pt-24) consistent with the recent modal fix.\n\nThe old per-week \"current pot\" tile from PotSummaryCard is removed\nhere — the spec''s Money card is entry + pot + weekly share only. If it\nshould come back it belongs on ThisWeekCard, not here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f148a324284e2e5e5e9577799b5d8c1f56a77211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/f148a324284e2e5e5e9577799b5d8c1f56a77211"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGViZGQzZjc2MWY4ZDQ5NWQ0N2RkOTNhN2FlOTAyNTJlYmZjOGE0ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9","sha":"cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9"}],"sha":"ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/ebdd3f761f8d495d47dd93a7ae90252ebfc8a482"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T20:43:30Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T20:43:30Z","email":"brooks@amazing.com","name":"brooks-amazing"},"message":"ux: anchor Account + Members modals to top of viewport\n\nSame fix as the previous TeamsTab commit, applied everywhere else that\nuses the `fixed inset-0 flex items-center` overlay pattern:\n\n  • Account.tsx — shared Modal component (leave-league, delete-league,\n    delete-account confirmations)\n  • MembersTab.tsx — remove-member modal (both variants: cancel pending\n    invite copy vs remove joined member copy) and the bulk-resend\n    confirmation\n\nitems-center → items-start with pt-16 sm:pt-24. Same rationale: mobile\nSafari''s 100vh includes address-bar chrome, and on tall pages the eye\nalready lives near the top — a centered dialog can land below the fold\nand the user misses that anything happened.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e61de487da3d08fb91e712018a00e9b73a7e932e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/trees/e61de487da3d08fb91e712018a00e9b73a7e932e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/git/commits/cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245206715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brooks-amazing","id":245206715,"login":"brooks-amazing","node_id":"U_kgDODp2Ouw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooks-amazing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9","node_id":"C_kwDORg5bXtoAKGNkOTU4ZWExYTlhYmIzNzRiM2E3YjM5YWVmODA1ODZlNWEzODE0Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bjuneau/19pool/commit/aed45001e7c4788eb62d86dc9cbaffd8cf5f0d22","sha":"aed45001e7c4788eb62d86dc9cbaffd8cf5f0d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/aed45001e7c4788eb62d86dc9cbaffd8cf5f0d22"}],"sha":"cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits/cd958ea1a9abb374b3a7b39aef80586e5a3814f9"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/bjuneau/19pool/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=1368df79d3cbf8d546a3a6428a3e322e2fa4e3ea&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A21%3A39.215Z"}');
