l.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"fix: apply container_file_t SELinux context to all datascience volumes\n\nThe chmod fix alone was insufficient — Fedora SELinux blocks container access\nto files with user_tmp_t context. Apply container_file_t to all of\n/tmp/datascience/ (not just minio/data) so Airflow and Jupyter can read\ntheir mounted DAGs and notebooks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05b9c4d5cd460a98d9214f8cbd9ae8d3cb5d2912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/05b9c4d5cd460a98d9214f8cbd9ae8d3cb5d2912"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/e156f635a9ce0cdaae14e729f45504ae66cce180","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/e156f635a9ce0cdaae14e729f45504ae66cce180","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKGUxNTZmNjM1YTljZTBjZGFhZTE0ZTcyOWY0NTUwNGFlNjZjY2UxODA","parents":[{