MinIO, and loads data into DuckDB for cross-source\nqueries in Notebook 02.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58e98afcd7f8f638ab8d82fe3523ee4d4f6b2e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/58e98afcd7f8f638ab8d82fe3523ee4d4f6b2e2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/439caedd30bc1c961d3ab30006050fccf5e424a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/439caedd30bc1c961d3ab30006050fccf5e424a5","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKDQzOWNhZWRkMzBiYzFjOTYxZDNhYjMwMDA2MDUwZmNjZjVlNDI0YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/a22bdc5e40da6af4ae61dc1bfd27f43f8acbc65d","sha":"a22bdc5e40da6af4ae61dc1bfd27f43f8acbc65d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/a22bdc5e40da6af4ae61dc1bfd27f43f8acbc65d"}],"sha":"439caedd30bc1c961d3ab30006050fccf5e424a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/439caedd30bc1c961d3ab30006050fccf5e424a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/a22bdc5e40da6af4ae61dc1bfd27f43f8acbc65d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T03:48:57Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T03:48:57Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Add weather data science notebooks, DAGs, and shared helpers\n\nImplement the data science pipeline for downloading open weather datasets,\nsyncing Kafka CDC events to DuckDB, and analyzing weather data interactively.\n\nShared helpers: MinIO utilities (minio_helper.py) and dataset downloaders\n(weather_sources.py) for NOAA GHCN-Daily and Open-Meteo APIs.\n\nDAGs: download_weather_datasets (daily MinIO-first ingestion from NOAA/\nOpen-Meteo) and kafka_cdc_to_duckdb (5-min Kafka CDC → DuckDB sync).\n\nNotebooks: 01_eda_open_meteo (EDA with 6 plot types) and\n02_cdc_duckdb_analysis (CDC stream analysis with cross-source comparison).\n\nInfrastructure: updated Containerfiles with matplotlib/seaborn/confluent-kafka,\nadded shared volume mounts to pod manifest, sync-files script and nx target.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7110d464536e9bab75051d9634d47e388f3f2b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/e7110d464536e9bab75051d9634d47e388f3f2b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/a22bdc5e40da6af4ae61dc1bfd27f43f8acbc65d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/a22bdc5e40da6af4ae61dc1bfd27f43f8acbc65d","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKGEyMmJkYzVlNDBkYTZhZjRhZTYxZGMxYmZkMjdmNDNmOGFjYmM2NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/6982bf959070c1bf3039c