tions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/9031e2f4f59687e1378736583ea79dfe3924c10b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T01:16:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T01:16:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix unit test failures after @org/ui shared library integration\n\nThree test suites (shell, weather-app, weatheredit-app) were broken after\nintegrating @org/ui components. Root causes: missing Vite resolve aliases\nfor @org/ui, deleted nx-welcome import in shell test, incorrect tempClass\nexpectations in weatheredit-app, and external styleUrl causing JIT\nresource resolution failures.\n\nFixes:\n- Add @org/ui resolve.alias to all three vite configs\n- Rewrite shell app.spec.ts for current App component\n- Use overrideComponent to skip @org/ui child rendering in tests\n- Fix assertion mismatches (loading text, temp cells, tempClass values)\n- Convert weatheredit-app entry from external styleUrl to inline styles\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01GyxFybi2w48yMtMS6wdaD8","tree":{"sha":"d76ad3f9f12707574fd3ed0946b69302baf139a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/d76ad3f9f12707574fd3ed0946b69302baf139a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/9031e2f4f59687e1378736583ea79dfe3924c10b","verification":{"payload":"tree d76ad3f9f12707574fd3ed0946b69302baf139a0\nparent 4db7674d5ac96ce1a70dd50b22a1edb697e6abaa\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773796612 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773796612 +0000\n\nFix unit test failures after @org/ui shared library integration\n\nThree test suites (shell, weather-app, weatheredit-app) were broken after\nintegrating @org/ui components. Root causes: missing Vite resolve aliases\nfor @org/ui, deleted nx-welcome import in shell test, incorrect tempClass\nexpectations in weatheredit-app, and external styleUrl causing JIT\nresource resolution failures.\n\nFixes:\n- Add @org/ui resolve.alias to all three vite configs\n- Rewrite shell app.spec.ts for current App component\n- Use overrideComponent to skip @org/ui child rendering in tests\n- Fix assertion mismatches (loading text, temp cells, tempClass values)\n- Convert weatheredit-app entry from external styleUrl to inline styles\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01GyxFybi2w48yMtMS6wdaD8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJFYgOvp\nT6GgRemvLWOpPJapiT+c1KFTe3Fr4JkqI7HT4WFWG1l0BK+KRtGXQDAnxqFost4600/FJExUdgYo\ngwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T01:17:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/9031e2f4f59687e1378736583ea79dfe3924c10b","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKDkwMzFlMmY0ZjU5Njg3