er\n- Redesign shell app with sidebar navigation layout and dashboard home page\n- Update all remote apps (weather-app, weatheredit-app, admin-app) to use shared components\n- Install primeng, @primeng/themes, primeicons, @angular/animations\n- Configure tsconfig paths and MFE includes for @org/ui resolution\n- Update README.md and SUMMARY.md documentation\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DhH4mNdF4xcdFXyEPD7d4i","tree":{"sha":"414f8ce27b447a2fb0607a16249b860eb692f19e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/414f8ce27b447a2fb0607a16249b860eb692f19e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/4db7674d5ac96ce1a70dd50b22a1edb697e6abaa","verification":{"payload":"tree 414f8ce27b447a2fb0607a16249b860eb692f19e\nparent c655fa5948c94d2f2636e798c62d963fe46f3558\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773786726 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773786726 +0000\n\nAdd shared UI library (@org/ui) with PrimeNG for consistent design across all Angular apps\n\n- Create libs/shared/ui with LayoutComponent (sidebar nav), PageHeaderComponent,\n  CardComponent, StatusBadgeComponent, and PrimeNG Aura theme provider\n- Redesign shell app with sidebar navigation layout and dashboard home page\n- Update all remote apps (weather-app, weatheredit-app, admin-app) to use shared components\n- Install primeng, @primeng/themes, primeicons, @angular/animations\n- Configure tsconfig paths and MFE includes for @org/ui resolution\n- Update README.md and SUMMARY.md documentation\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DhH4mNdF4xcdFXyEPD7d4i\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLDNp8an\nlIHyNnqXGgI7fXjPjZ6uOqsSgSb7r7/1pbAQFQngFG0pEo058kM6BqeGLdNc1b5fmUNQk1KOYD/a\nPgk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T22:32:13