229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/c655fa5948c94d2f2636e798c62d963fe46f3558/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T00:25:08Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T00:25:08Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Add Kafka CDC pod with Debezium and monitoring\n\nAdd a standalone Kafka CDC pod and observability for Postgres→Kafka Change Data Capture. Introduces k8s/kafka-pod.yaml (Kafka KRaft, Schema Registry, Debezium Connect with Avro + JMX exporter, debezium-init, Kafka UI, slot-guard), Containerfiles and helper scripts for debezium, debezium-init and slot-guard, and an Nx project with podman build/run targets. Enable logical replication in the Postgres image, add a postgres-exporter to the observability pod, add Prometheus scrape jobs for postgres and Debezium, and add a Grafana \"Kafka & CDC\" dashboard. Also update Traefik routing for Kafka UI, add a Kafka UI link to the admin dashboard, and document build/run instructions in README.md and RUN.md. Purpose: provide Avro-encoded CDC from PostgreSQL to Kafka, monitoring across producer/consumer layers, and an automated safety net to drop stale replication slots.","tree":{"sha":"a574f6e2c9311f1c92ebc1fada34342e27f82b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/a574f6e2c9311f1c92ebc1fada34342e27f82b2b"},"url":"https