/api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/248aab33ce78872c0b11d735919f68fb9f2a6436/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T17:08:11Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T17:08:11Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Fix observability services & configs\n\nMultiple fixes to observability stack to resolve SELinux, config, and concurrency issues:\n\n- Add SELinux relabeling (chcon -Rt container_file_t) when creating hostPath log dirs so containers can write logs (apps/shell/project.json).\n- Quote JMESPath identifier in Promtail JSON stage to avoid parsing the hyphen in User-Agent (apps/observability/promtail/promtail.yml).\n- Remove Traefik strip-grafana-prefix middleware to prevent infinite redirects when Grafana is served from a sub-path (traefik/traefik-dynamic.yml).\n- Use ThreadingHTTPServer in the auth-proxy so forwardAuth checks can handle many concurrent requests (apps/observability/auth-proxy/auth-proxy.py).\n- Add explicit uids for Prometheus and Loki datasources so Grafana dashboards find their datasources (apps/observability/grafana/provisioning/datasources/prometheus.yml, .../loki.yml).\n\nThese changes fix crashes, redirect loops, missing data in dashboards, and dropped auth checks observed during testing.","tree":{"sha":"b7dd8a9dd2d969809a5116e2adf01641a3547726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/b7dd8a9dd2d969809a5116e2adf01641a3547726"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/248aab33ce78872c0b11d735919f68fb9f2a6436","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/248aab33ce78872c0b11d735919f68fb9f2a6436","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKDI0OGFhYjMzY2U3ODg3MmMwYjExZDczNTkxOWY2OGZiOWYyYTY0MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee","sha":"cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee"}],"sha":"248aab33ce78872c0b11d735919f68fb9f2a6436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/248aab33ce78872c0b11d735919f68fb9f2a6436"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T04:29:09Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T04:29:09Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Make kube-up log dir creation portable\n\nkube-up previously used an unconditional `podman machine ssh` to create host log directories, which fails on native Linux CI where Podman runs without a VM. Replace the command with a conditional: run `podman machine ssh` only if `podman machine inspect` succeeds, otherwise create the directories directly with `sudo mkdir` on the host. Updated apps/shell/project.json accordingly and documented the change in SUMMARY.md.","tree":{"sha":"1d5fe0ee02a83f5478a4faba82816d0f79cd58f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/1d5fe0ee02a83f5478a4faba82816d0f79cd58f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKGNhY2IyMWFiY2E4MTUwM2E1MTA2NzdlMjA2OTZhZDM4ZWQzOGI4ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/bfc67aff7fca02f458c61b5e5d3987e626cee1b2","sha":"bfc67aff7fca02f458c61b5e5d3987e626cee1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/bfc67aff7fca02f458c61b5e5d3987e626cee1b2"}],"sha":"cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/cacb21abca81503a510677e20696ad38ed38b8ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/bfc67aff7fca02f458c61b5e5d3987e626cee1b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T04:04:23Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T04:04:23Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Remove podman image prune from shell build\n\nRemove the redundant and harmful `podman image prune -af` from the shell:podman-build target to avoid Podman storage corruption during Nx parallel builds. Nx runs podman-build targets concurrently, and the prune could delete images/layers other builds had just created, causing \"image not known\" errors. Storage cleanup is already performed by `podman system reset --force` in CI, so this commit simply deletes the prune command from apps/shell/project.json.","tree":{"sha":"7dfd580e2e30b78f3173f33dbbabaa36ab8c2a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/7dfd580e2e30b78f3173f33dbbabaa36ab8c2a08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/bfc67aff7fca02f458c61b5e5d3987e626cee1b2","verificati