events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/2ae9544474beab76212fab5b7b2a5480a7328eb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T02:30:00Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T02:30:00Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Add Grafana SSO via Kratos auth-proxy\n\nEnable passwordless Grafana SSO using Ory Kratos by adding a lightweight auth-proxy and Traefik forwardAuth route. New files: auth-proxy.py (verifies Kratos /sessions/whoami and returns X-Webauth-User) and Containerfile. Updates: traefik-dynamic.yml (grafana router, grafana service, grafana-auth forwardAuth middleware, strip prefix), k8s/observability-pod.yaml (auth-proxy container + Grafana proxy/sub-path env vars), apps/observability/project.json (podman build target for auth-proxy), and apps/ory/kratos.yml (allowed return URLs for Grafana). This wires Traefik -> auth-proxy -> Kratos to auto-sign-in Grafana users and redirect unauthenticated users to Kratos login.","tree":{"sha":"3d4b1b2de53998669a7d0a398a28a58e46dadc9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/3d4b1b2de53998669a7d0a398a28a58e46dadc9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/2ae9544474beab76212fab5b7b2a5480a7328eb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/2ae9544474beab76212fab5b7b2a5480a7328eb4","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKDJhZTk1NDQ0NzRiZWFiNzYyMTJmYWI1YjdiMmE1NDgwYTczMjhlYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/488dac0db6c5f71b8912708cbdfbe9e61f9aa47d","sha":"488dac0db6c5f71b8912708cbdfbe9e61f9aa47d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/488dac0db6c5f71b8912708cbdfbe9e61f9aa47d"}],"sha":"2ae9544474beab76212fab5b7b2a5480a7328eb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/2ae9544474beab76212fab5b7b2a5480a7328eb4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/488dac0db6c5f71b8912708cbdfbe9e61f9aa47d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T02:23:44Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T02:23:44Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Add observability pipeline and dashboard\n\nEnable full observability: route logs to Loki and metrics to Prometheus, and add a Grafana \"System Health\" dashboard. Key changes:\n- Traefik: enable JSON access logs and Prometheus metrics (traefik.yml) and create /var/log/traefik in Containerfile.\n- Nginx: add JSON log format and write access logs to /var/log/nginx.\n- Prometheus: add a scrape job for Traefik.\n- Promtail: add traefik-access and nginx-access scrape jobs with JSON parsing and label extraction.\n- Kubernetes pods: mount hostPath volumes for /var/log/traefik and /var/log/nginx in apps and observability pods (read-only for observability).\n- Add Grafana provisioning dashboard apps/observability/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/system-health.json.\n- Update SUMMARY.md with a high-level description of the observability step.\n\nThese changes provide structured logs, instrumented metrics, and a dashboard showing system health, pod/container counts, request/error metrics, top client IP+User-Agent combos, and recent error logs.","tree":{"sha":"e77bacf9ac2996479fa89c254a1f6607a08b7bc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/e77bacf9ac2996479fa89c254a1f6607a08b7bc4"},"url":"https://api.