ml_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/c5bf7421c8e4817d5a62b266a80126f5141ab2a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T02:05:12Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T02:05:12Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Fix admin-app CORS and convert KratosAdmin to signals\n\nResolve CORS and stale UI issues in the admin micro-frontend. Changed the health badge endpoint to use the Traefik-proxied path (/.ory/kratos/admin/health/alive) instead of a hardcoded http://localhost:4434 URL to avoid cross-origin blocking. Converted template-bound properties in KratosAdminComponent to Angular signals (signal()) so MF callbacks that run outside Angular zone still update the UI, and updated the component template and logic to use signal getters/setters. Updated unit tests to use the proxied ADMIN_URL and to read signal values via function calls.\n\nFiles touched:\n- apps/admin-app/src/app/remote-entry/entry.ts (health badge endpoint -> proxied path)\n- apps/admin-app/src/app/kratos-admin/kratos-admin.component.ts (properties -> signals, template updates)\n- apps/admin-app/src/app/kratos-admin/kratos-admin.component.spec.ts (tests updated for signals)\n- apps/admin-app/src/app/kratos-admin/kratos-admin.service.spec.ts (ADMIN_URL -> proxied path)\n- CLAUDE.md and SUMMARY.md (documentation of the fixes and rationale)","tree":{"sha":"e227aa1997d619a602c52cdf8ea8840078f98589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/e227aa1997d619a602c52cdf8ea8840078f98589"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/c5bf7421c8e4817d5a62b266a80126f5141ab2a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/c5bf7421c8e4817d5a62b266a80126f5141ab2a2","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKGM1YmY3NDIxYzhlNDgxN2Q1YTYyYjI2NmE4MDEyNmY1MTQxYWIyYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903","sha":"8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903"}],"sha":"c5bf7421c8e4817d5a62b266a80126f5141ab2a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/c5bf7421c8e4817d5a62b266a80126f5141ab2a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T01:16:10Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T01:16:10Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Proxy Kratos admin API; rebuild shell image & docs\n\nFix CORS and stale image issues: proxy the Ory Kratos admin API through Traefik at /.ory/kratos/admin and update the admin-app to use the proxied path instead of a hardcoded http://localhost:4434. Add Traefik router, service and strip-prefix middleware for the admin API. Prevent \"no space left\" build failures by pruning images before building the shell container and make the shell kube-up depend on the podman-build target so the image is rebuilt. Update documentation and SUMMARY to reflect the new admin-app route and the changes.\n\nFiles changed: apps/admin-app/src/app/kratos-admin/kratos-admin.service.ts, traefik/traefik-dynamic.yml, apps/shell/project.json, README.md, SUMMARY.md.","tree":{"sha":"169ffb26181bc6111e5186f4e746b00598afe876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/169ffb26181bc6111e5186f4e746b00598afe876"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903","node_id":"C_kwDORg7WcdoAKDhjNDM0ZWNjODg4ZDBkZTRlYzM4ODVmMTFjMDFlYjNhMWFlZjI5MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commit/c0333ca38e9d07dc3b933a8599c38c702e0c3f38","sha":"c0333ca38e9d07dc3b933a8599c38c702e0c3f38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/c0333ca38e9d07dc3b933a8599c38c702e0c3f38"}],"sha":"8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/8c434ecc888d0de4ec3885f11c01eb3a1aef2903"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/commits/c0333ca38e9d07dc3b933a8599c38c702e0c3f38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T00:46:04Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T00:46:04Z","email":"joe.barbere@gmail.com","name":"Joe Barbere"},"message":"Add Kratos admin UI, health badges, and fixes\n\nIntroduce a full Ory Kratos identity management UI and related fixes:\n\n- Add KratosAdminService and KratosAdminComponent (CRUD for identities, inline role editing, delete, create form, health badge) and corresponding unit tests. Wire component into admin-app routes.\n- Update RemoteEntry to use routerLink for the Kratos tile, add health badges, display Grafana credentials, change Weather API docs link to Scalar endpoint, and implement health checks via HttpClient. Update RemoteEntry tests accordingly.\n- Register provideHttpClient() in admin-app app.config so components/services and tests can use HttpClient.\n- Add weather-api:podman-build to apps/shell kube-up dependsOn to ensure the image is built before podman play kube runs.\n- Enable OpenAPI/Scalar in weather-api (Program.cs) for production docs, enable Traefik API/dashboard and add an 8081 entrypoint in traefik.yml, and expose Traefik dashboard port in k8s/apps-pod.yaml.\n- Improve shell auth unit tests (auth.guard.spec.ts and auth.service.spec.ts) to cover additional guards and HTTP behaviors.\n- Update SUMMARY.md with notes about these steps.\n\nThese changes replace a raw Kratos JSON link with an in-app admin page, improve dashboard usability (health status and credentials), ensure build/deploy ordering, and increase test coverage.","tree":{"sha":"281625c1b732e70ea2f202a0e705ddab4d88f3bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/trees/281625c1b732e70ea2f202a0e705ddab4d88f3bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joebarbere/claude-hello-world/git/commits/c0333ca38e9d07dc3b933a8599c38c702e0c3f38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joebarbere","id":198229,"login":"joebarbere","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODIyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joebarbere/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gith