":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/commits/f38d58fe894f930450720915a14985bfcc5eff44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:07:02Z","email":"tech@zekrost.com","name":"Jose Vasquez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:07:02Z","email":"tech@zekrost.com","name":"Jose Vasquez"},"message":"feat: v3.3.0 — native partial attribute interpolation + browser E2E suite\n\n- Runtime normalization of partial attribute interpolation into single\n  canonical bindings (one effect, one DOM write per flush) via a cached\n  pure lexer over the cooked template strings.\n- String() coercion per segment (template-literal semantics: ${1}${2}\n  renders \"12\"), full bindings keep null/false attribute-removal.\n- URL attributes sanitized as a composed unit; @event, ref/show/hide and\n  HTML boolean partials rejected with descriptive errors; unclosed\n  quoted values and dynamic tag/attr names throw.\n- templateFeatures.partialAttributeInterpolation capability export.\n- Templates without partials keep byte-identical fast-path behavior.\n- Playwright E2E suite (Chromium/Firefox/WebKit) covering static,\n  reactivity, security, SSR/hydration/streaming, keyed and errors.\n- Fix: static repeat() keyed lists on mount rendered [object Object].\n- Docs: README, .readme-npm, CHANGELOG; bundle size 15 KB gzip.","tree":{"sha":"c37fc072312c3a76558fabe2a22249de91678103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/trees/c37fc072312c3a76558fabe2a22249de91678103"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/commits/f38d58fe894f930450720915a14985bfcc5eff44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer