quez"},"message":"v3.0.3: keyed hydration, streaming chunks, render protocols, raw helper, oxc minification\n\n- Keyed hydration for repeat() (SSR key markers, LIS adoption/reorder, duplicate diagnostics)\n- Array range delimiters (nix-ai/nix-aiend) fixing marker-index collisions in hydration\n- Interaction-before-hydration: value/checked/selected sync via microtask\n- renderToChunks(), createServerRenderScope(), RenderErrorInfo, onServerRender\n- NIX_RENDER_PROTOCOL mountDom/hydrateDom + raw() trusted HTML\n- Minify with Oxc + artifact smoke (ESM/CJS); .d.cts types + import/require conditions\n- preserveModules runtime aligned with per-module declarations (arethetypeswrong clean)\n- SSR/hydration matrix tests (628 total)","tree":{"sha":"ad3d4af5670fe7021aed1918a9d604418a455193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/trees/ad3d4af5670fe7021aed1918a9d604418a455193"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/commits/07b6f9ee8dd748191fa6d9cba5f6a1ecc960779f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265048074?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zekrost","id":265048074,"login":"Zekrost","node_id":"U_kgDOD8xQCg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github