ent plugin system, $watch API, and comprehensive state safety fixes\n- Add signal-native plugin architecture and reactive $dispose lifecycle.\n- Replace $subscribe with $watch for consistent reactivity patterns.\n- Fix: block prototype pollution in assertKey (__proto__, constructor, prototype).\n- Fix: add structuredClone validation with descriptive error for non-serializable initialState.\n- Fix: harden read-only getters with immutable descriptors and descriptive errors.\n- Fix: use hasOwnProperty in $patch and batch updates for better performance and safety.\n- Fix: enforce Signal type validation in getters with explicit TypeError.\n- Optimize: use batch() for atomic state updates in $reset and $patch.","tree":{"sha":"6b48fe2bd507c99304aa5ba5947972b9dd15d4ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/trees/6b48fe2bd507c99304aa5ba5947972b9dd15d4ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/commits/c8e68bedd4ca0c50aa76df1a87e8da6610b59dda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265048074?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zekrost","id":265048074,"login":"Zekrost","node_id":"U_kgDOD8xQCg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zekrost