MTdjYWIxMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/commit/60ec23dfa1d0531cb1d6fcd88b5d3aee27e677ed","sha":"60ec23dfa1d0531cb1d6fcd88b5d3aee27e677ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/commits/60ec23dfa1d0531cb1d6fcd88b5d3aee27e677ed"}],"sha":"1d6f7827ae1346184c3bfaf70d6ccedd17cab130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/commits/1d6f7827ae1346184c3bfaf70d6ccedd17cab130"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93833397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DeijoseDevelop","id":93833397,"login":"DeijoseDevelop","node_id":"U_kgDOBZfItQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/commits/60ec23dfa1d0531cb1d6fcd88b5d3aee27e677ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T18:56:26Z","email":"estudiandovazmore@gmail.com","name":"Deiver Vasquez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T18:56:26Z","email":"estudiandovazmore@gmail.com","name":"Deiver Vasquez"},"message":"perf(template): O(depth) marker resolution, bulk clear, frag move buffer — v1.5.5\n\nAll 7 benchmark operations improved vs. v1.3.0 stable baseline (1,000 rows):\n\n  Create      220ms → 90ms   (–59% JS)   603ms → 187ms  (–69% full)\n  Replace     286ms → 87ms   (–69% JS)   567ms → 170ms  (–70% full)\n  Swap         53ms → 17ms   (–68% JS)   380ms → 131ms  (–66% full)\n  Clear        43ms → 23ms   (–46% JS)   307ms →  31ms  (–90% full)\n  Delete      1.9ms → 0.6ms  (–68% JS)    44ms →  35ms  (–21% full)\n  Update      0.8ms → 0.5ms  (–37% JS)    40ms →  32ms  (–20% full)\n  Select      0.3ms → 0.2ms  (–33% JS)                  ~flat full\n\nChanges:\n\n- Pre-compute childNodes index paths (commentMarkers, attrMarkers) from\n  DocumentFragment root to each marker once per template literal via\n  _computePath. Every render clone resolves markers via _walkPath —\n  a plain node.childNodes[step] loop — eliminating TreeWalker and\n  querySelectorAll from the per-row hot path entirely.\n  Null-safe: _walkPath returns null on out-of-bounds access (browser-\n  inserted implicit nodes like <tbody> shift indices). On any miss a\n  lazy _lazyScanComments / _lazyScanAttrs fallback runs once per clone,\n  memoized, transparent to callers.\n\n- Insert a <!--nix-kz--> zone marker once before the first keyed entry.\n  Full clear now issues a single Range.deleteContents() instead of N\n  removeChild calls. entry.cleanup() still runs per-entry for effect\n  disposal — DOM ops inside are no-ops (nodes already detached).\n\n- Collect keyed entry nodes into a DocumentFragment via appendChild\n  (extracts from live DOM) and reinsert with a single insertBefore.\n  Replaces Node[] array + N insertBefore — eliminates array allocation\n  and halves DOM ops per move.\n\n- Build Set<string> once at listener registration for event modifier\n  checks. Per-fire has() is O(1) vs includes() O(n).\n\n- WeakMap<TemplateStringsArray, TemplateCache> parse cache: HTML\n  parsing, buildHTML, and context detection run once per call site.\n\n- Extract _mountComponent, _mountComponentSilent, _mountComponentWithCtx,\n  _mountComponentDeferred helpers — replace ~9 inline push/pop context +\n  lifecycle repetitions. createErrorBoundary keeps its inline block to\n  intercept errored between render and mount phases.\n\n- COMMENT constants object; KEntry to module level; skipLeading →\n  Set<number>; KEY_MAP to module level; _cssMaxDuration parseFloat fix;\n  _waitTransitionEnd simplified; loop var i → idx in keyed list map.","tree":{"sha":"e8903545426e47cf7ae87a3f4fac0812d803a2f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/trees/e8903545426e47cf7ae87a3f4fac0812d803a2f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/git/commits/60ec23dfa1d0531cb1d6fcd88b5d3aee27e677ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93833397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DeijoseDevelop","id":93833397,"login":"DeijoseDevelop","node_id":"U_kgDOBZfItQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeijoseDevelop","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/commit/60ec23dfa1d0531cb1d6fcd88b5d3aee27e677ed","node_id":"C_kwDORhCPd9oAKDYwZWMyM2RmYTFkMDUzMWNiMWQ2ZmNkODhiNWQzYWVlMjdlNjc3ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DeijoseDevelop/nix-js/commi