},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T02:38:58Z","email":"ezequielmarinho860@gmail.com","name":"ezequielmarinho860-kda"},"message":"feat: add custom token alert rules backend\n\nPer-user \"when it hits\" price/mcap alert rules (stage 48 table) evaluated by\nthe user alert matcher on every token update. Direction is derived from the\nmarket baseline captured at rule creation, so a rule fires on the first\nevaluation that reaches the target even when no evaluation pair straddles it.\n\n- CRUD routes under /api/dashboard/custom-alert-rules (create/list/update/\n  disable) with baseline capture and typed 400 validation errors\n- trigger-once via transactional markTriggered status guard\n- optional expiry stored in rule metadata and filtered out in SQL\n- k/m/b shorthand target parsing; optional custom MP3 sound (scoped 8mb JSON\n  body limit for that route only, friendly 413/400 body errors)\n- custom-alert events flow through the dashboard alert feed and chart history\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9222c9c49c13dba8820c9f7987a1b9a447e96c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oshael/Volume-Bot-Alert/git/trees/9222c9c49c13dba8820c9f7987a1b9a447e96c58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oshael/Volume-Bot-Alert/git/commits/68deb4f0e08eaedcc3ae5e4983696406622ad4a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251090477?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oshael","id":251090477,"login":"Oshael","node_id":"U_kgDODvdWLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/orgs","received_events_url":"h