e":"2026-07-01T18:30:28Z","email":"ezequielmarinho860@gmail.com","name":"ezequielmarinho860-kda"},"message":"Add 1h/4h/24h aggregate market bucket granularities\n\nExpands aggregate sparkline granularities to 60/240/1440 minutes:\n\n- market-bucket-granularities.js: single source of truth for granularity\n  sets (aggregate + on-write + sparkline whitelist).\n- db-init-stage47.js: migrates the token_market_buckets_agg\n  granularity_minutes CHECK to allow 60/240/1440 (NOT VALID + VALIDATE).\n- db-init-stage38.js / runtime-schema.js: fresh-install constraint and a\n  stage47 schema-check group.\n- backfill-market-buckets-agg.js: epoch-based bucket boundaries (required\n  for >60m granularities; identical for 5/15/30) and full granularity set.\n- On-write aggregation still recomputes only 5/15/30 (no write\n  amplification); 60/240/1440 are populated via backfill/worker.\n- API validates granularity against the whitelist; frontend carries\n  candle/granularity fields but never requests >30m yet (no empty-bucket\n  exposure until backfilled).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"faefe5f126383d4caa1345c709faf0a2a4f1dfac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oshael/Volume-Bot-Alert/git/trees/faefe5f126383d4caa1345c709faf0a2a4f1dfac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oshael/Volume-Bot-Alert/git/commits/43a3b7d0a2aa85534613432529e8d100b7866999","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251090477?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oshael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oshael","id":251090477,"login":"Oshael","node_id":"U_kgDODvdWLQ","organizations_url":"http