owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Agi-Developer","id":6834116,"login":"Agi-Developer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzQxMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commits/26f8b42a5f879b5b40ad5e5e8897c34c583fe65f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T21:39:58Z","email":"agilandeena41@gmail.com","name":"Agi-Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T21:39:58Z","email":"agilandeena41@gmail.com","name":"Agi-Developer"},"message":"Add Phase 2: Event-Driven Architecture — 49 services + Kafka\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Kafka (KRaft mode), Schema Registry, Kafka UI via docker-compose overlay\n- Shared Kafka library: EventProducer, EventConsumer, Topics in mobility-common\n- 30+ new PostgreSQL tables across 8 schemas (drivers, trips, vehicles,\n  dispatch, pricing, payments, comms, marketplace) with PostGIS support\n\nServices (49 new, 500 tests):\n- Driver domain (8): driver, location, availability, matching, rating,\n  earnings, document, incentive\n- Trip & Vehicle domain (11): trip, ride-request, tracking, feedback,\n  history, route, location, vehicle, inspection, maintenance, vehicle-type\n- Dispatch, Pricing & Payment (14): dispatch, pricing, surge, discount,\n  promotion, fare-calculation, dynamic-pricing-ai, payment, payment-method,\n  refund, payout, wallet, fare-split, toll\n- Communication & Real-time (9): notification, push, email, sms, chat,\n  presence, websocket-gateway, search, autocomplete\n- Marketplace (4): loyalty, fleet-management, subscription, support-ticket\n\nLearning Modules (6 new, 119 tests):\n- M07: Domain-Driven Design (bounded contexts, aggregates)\n- M08: Event-Driven Architecture (event bus, saga, event sourcing)\n- M09: Dispatch Algorithms (nearest driver, scoring, Hungarian)\n- M10: Dynamic Pricing (supply/demand, surge models, elasticity)\n- M11: Real-time Communication (pub/sub, backpressure, presence)\n- M12: Geospatial (haversine, H3 grid, geohash)\n\nTotal: 68 services (16 Phase 1 + 49 Phase 2 + 3 infra), 845 tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6331aa2dfe4b49a5832a011e6d2f249202e6eba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/git/trees/f6331aa2dfe4b49a5832a011e6d2f249202e6eba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/git/commits/26f8b42a5f879b5b40ad5e5e8897c34c583fe65f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6834116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Agi-Developer","id":6834116,"login":"Agi-Developer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzQxMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commit/26f8b42a5f879b5b40ad5e5e8897c34c583fe65f","node_id":"C_kwDORhOUldoAKDI2ZjhiNDJhNWY4NzliNWI0MGFkNWU1ZTg4OTdjMzRjNTgzZmU2NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commit/f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23","sha":"f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commits/f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23"}],"sha":"26f8b42a5f879b5b40ad5e5e8897c34c583fe65f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commits/26f8b42a5f879b5b40ad5e5e8897c34c583fe65f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6834116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Agi-Developer","id":6834116,"login":"Agi-Developer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzQxMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commits/f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T11:55:24Z","email":"agilandeena41@gmail.com","name":"Agi-Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T11:55:24Z","email":"agilandeena41@gmail.com","name":"Agi-Developer"},"message":"Add Phase 1 microservices: 16 services across 4 domains\n\nBuilt 16 real microservices with full CRUD APIs, tests, and Docker support:\n\nIdentity Domain (6 services, ports 8010-8015):\n- auth-service: Register, login, JWT token pairs, refresh rotation\n- session-service: Active session management, device tracking\n- otp-service: SHA-256 hashed OTP generation and verification\n- access-control-service: RBAC with wildcard permission matching\n- device-service: Device fingerprinting and trust management\n- sso-service: OAuth2 provider integration (Google, GitHub, Microsoft)\n\nUser Domain (5 services, ports 8020-8024):\n- user-service: User CRUD with cursor pagination\n- profile-service: Extended profiles with upsert\n- address-service: Saved addresses with default selection\n- activity-service: User activity logging and history\n- preferences-service: JSONB key-value preferences\n\nConfig Domain (2 services, ports 8030-8031):\n- config-service: Versioned runtime configuration\n- feature-flag-service: Flag evaluation with rollout percentages,\n  role targeting, and per-user overrides\n\nGateway Domain (3 TypeScript services, ports 8000-8002):\n- api-gateway: Express proxy with Redis rate limiting, JWT auth,\n  circuit breaker (per-service), routing to all 13 backends\n- graphql-gateway: Apollo Server with schema stitching\n- bff-service: Aggregation endpoints (/me, /dashboard)\n\nShared infrastructure:\n- mobility-common FastAPI package: app factory, JWT middleware,\n  RBAC, cursor pagination, RFC 7807 errors, async SQLAlchemy\n- Extended PostgreSQL schema: 17 tables across 3 schemas\n- Docker Compose: 19 services with health checks and dependency ordering\n\nTest results: 226 tests passing (216 Python + 10 TypeScript)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5a6ed6051035f4419d6856e9c047455cbe758e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/git/trees/c5a6ed6051035f4419d6856e9c047455cbe758e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/git/commits/f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6834116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Agi-Developer","id":6834116,"login":"Agi-Developer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzQxMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commit/f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23","node_id":"C_kwDORhOUldoAKGY3NDAyYTZhYWI4MDZiOThmY2I3MjczYWNlNTVjZDEzNzViZmJhMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commit/912a9a2ca5008aff9513e4f4b28a87d2a8f8aec2","sha":"912a9a2ca5008aff9513e4f4b28a87d2a8f8aec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commits/912a9a2ca5008aff9513e4f4b28a87d2a8f8aec2"}],"sha":"f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commits/f7402a6aab806b98fcb7273ace55cd1375bfba23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6834116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Agi-Developer","id":6834116,"login":"Agi-Developer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzQxMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commits/912a9a2ca5008aff9513e4f4b28a87d2a8f8aec2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T03:07:50Z","email":"agilandeena41@gmail.com","name":"Agi-Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T03:07:50Z","email":"agilandeena41@gmail.com","name":"Agi-Developer"},"message":"Initial project setup: monorepo skeleton, Phase 1 learning modules, docs site\n\nSmart Mobility & Analytics Platform - 2-year enterprise learning project\ncovering 155 microservices, 42 learning modules across 7 phases.\n\nWhat''s included:\n- Monorepo directory skeleton (156 service dirs across 20+ domains)\n- Phase 1 learning modules (6 modules): API Gateway, Auth, REST API,\n  Database Patterns, Caching, Containerization\n- 47 passing tests, 7 exercises with NotImplementedError stubs\n- Docusaurus documentation site with phase-organized sidebar\n- Docker Compose for Phase 1 infra (PostgreSQL, Redis, pgAdmin)\n- Shared Python library (mobility-common): domain models, events, utils\n- Data download script for NYC TLC taxi data (1.7B+ trips)\n- PostgreSQL init script with schemas and seed data\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdc2448c96ac0dedca938eb2ca9c79b27d59794e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/git/trees/cdc2448c96ac0dedca938eb2ca9c79b27d59794e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/git/commits/912a9a2ca5008aff9513e4f4b28a87d2a8f8aec2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6834116?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Agi-Developer","id":6834116,"login":"Agi-Developer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzQxMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Agi-Developer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/agilandeenadhayalan/EnterprisePlatform/commit/912a9a2ca5008aff9513e4f4b28a87d2a8f8aec2","node_id":"C_kwDORhOUldoAKDkxMmE5